WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:56.219 --> 00:00:58.555
- Something wrong
superintendent?


00:00:58.588 --> 00:01:00.991
- Absolutely not Robert.


00:01:02.124 --> 00:01:08.730
Please proceed.


00:01:12.867 --> 00:01:16.003
- There's nothing wrong with me.


00:01:16.036 --> 00:01:17.905
- Shh.


00:01:17.938 --> 00:01:20.840
Miss Puge we're
here to help you.


00:01:20.873 --> 00:01:22.675
No need to be afraid.


00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:24.544
The librium of the
scrotum as diagnosed...


00:01:24.576 --> 00:01:25.611
- Get on with it.


00:01:25.644 --> 00:01:26.245
- Miss Puge.


00:01:26.278 --> 00:01:27.179
- No.


00:01:27.212 --> 00:01:30.048
- No one is out to get you.


00:01:30.081 --> 00:01:33.684
You're safe, this is part
of your treatment here


00:01:33.717 --> 00:01:35.987
at Blackwell's Island.


00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:39.189
You do want to get
well, don't you?


00:01:41.724 --> 00:01:45.127
- No, no, no.


00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:46.295
No.


00:01:51.032 --> 00:01:53.001
- Feel better now don't you?


00:01:55.936 --> 00:01:58.539
- Mama.


00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:05.644
- Doctor Kinier.


00:02:05.677 --> 00:02:08.880
What's happening?


00:02:08.913 --> 00:02:11.181
- I don't know if I have enough.


00:02:28.729 --> 00:02:30.264
- Can you hear me?


00:02:30.297 --> 00:02:31.732
Talk to me.


00:02:31.765 --> 00:02:33.101
- Enough!


00:02:36.703 --> 00:02:40.639
Send her to the crematorium.


00:02:40.672 --> 00:02:42.775
I will make out the papers.


00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:29.663
- I wasn't
always known as Nellie Bly.


00:04:29.696 --> 00:04:32.265
I was born Elizabeth Cockringe
during the Civil War,


00:04:32.298 --> 00:04:34.200
outside of Pittsburgh,
Pennsylvania.


00:04:34.233 --> 00:04:37.302
Since I was a child, I
wanted to be a reporter.


00:04:37.335 --> 00:04:40.105
It'd been two years since I
wrote the Pittsburgh Dispatch,


00:04:40.138 --> 00:04:43.174
to criticize an article that
mocked women looking for work.


00:04:43.207 --> 00:04:46.077
The managing editor was so
impressed with my response,


00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:48.145
that he made the rare
choice of hiring me,


00:04:48.178 --> 00:04:51.081
a female to work as a reporter.


00:04:51.114 --> 00:04:54.350
You see in 1887, journalism
was a man's world,


00:04:54.383 --> 00:04:57.687
an exclusive,
albeit, crusty cigar,


00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.754
and spittoon filled club.


00:04:59.787 --> 00:05:01.189
The women were not welcomed.


00:05:01.222 --> 00:05:02.424
- Nellie Bly.


00:05:02.457 --> 00:05:03.757
We were
considered too dainty


00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.859
and fragile for such work.


00:05:05.892 --> 00:05:08.395
So how did I, the
fabled mere woman,


00:05:08.428 --> 00:05:10.763
fair sex, a faint heart,


00:05:10.796 --> 00:05:14.233
become the most known investigative reporter in the world.


00:05:14.266 --> 00:05:16.702
Well, I have always believed


00:05:16.735 --> 00:05:19.037
that energy rightly
applied and directed...


00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:20.172
- Come in.


00:05:20.205 --> 00:05:22.173
Will
accomplish anything.


00:05:25.409 --> 00:05:28.344
- Nellie Bly I'd like to
introduce you to our publisher,


00:05:28.377 --> 00:05:30.714
Joseph Pulitzer.


00:05:32.881 --> 00:05:35.117
- It's very nice to
meet you Mr. Pulitzer.


00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:37.019
It is a great honor.


00:05:40.187 --> 00:05:41.923
- Bly is not your real name.


00:05:41.956 --> 00:05:44.791
- No, Nellie Bly is my pen name.


00:05:44.824 --> 00:05:45.859
- She is small.


00:05:45.892 --> 00:05:46.860
- But plucky.


00:05:46.893 --> 00:05:48.028
- Is that enough?


00:05:48.061 --> 00:05:49.795
- Her recommendation
is impeccable.


00:05:49.828 --> 00:05:50.896
Her reputation is outstanding.


00:05:50.929 --> 00:05:52.798
I believe she was made for this.


00:05:52.831 --> 00:05:53.999
- She is unknown.


00:05:54.032 --> 00:06:00.706
If this fails, it is not her
reputation that is on the line.


00:06:04.241 --> 00:06:07.276
- I would live to thank you
for the advance, Mr. Cokerill.


00:06:07.309 --> 00:06:09.312
I am ready for any opportunity
the World Newspaper


00:06:09.345 --> 00:06:11.114
has for me.


00:06:11.147 --> 00:06:12.814
- I've spoken with Mr. Pulitzer


00:06:12.847 --> 00:06:14.983
about some of the
ideas you suggested.


00:06:15.016 --> 00:06:16.485
- Oh.


00:06:16.518 --> 00:06:18.320
- Would you really have
gone up in a balloon?


00:06:18.353 --> 00:06:20.121
- Without question.


00:06:20.154 --> 00:06:23.090
You gave the assignment to
a male reporter instead,


00:06:23.123 --> 00:06:25.458
I would have drawn
greater sensation.


00:06:25.491 --> 00:06:28.194
- No doubt.


00:06:28.227 --> 00:06:31.363
But we have another idea,


00:06:31.396 --> 00:06:33.298
the World Newspaper would
like you to infiltrate


00:06:33.331 --> 00:06:38.002
one of the asylums for the
insane in New York City.


00:06:39.236 --> 00:06:41.105
- To report on the
treatment of the patients?


00:06:41.138 --> 00:06:42.539
- Yes.


00:06:42.572 --> 00:06:44.207
- Which asylum?


00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:48.944
- Blackwell's Island
Lunatic Asylum for Women.


00:06:48.977 --> 00:06:51.113
- To get in, I will
have to be committed.


00:06:51.146 --> 00:06:54.949
- We can find a doctor who'd
be willing to sign the papers.


00:06:54.982 --> 00:06:57.485
- No I'll have to do it myself.


00:06:57.518 --> 00:06:59.953
The only sure way
I am not revealed


00:06:59.986 --> 00:07:02.957
is absolutely everyone
must believe I am insane.


00:07:04.857 --> 00:07:08.261
How will you get me out
after I once get in?


00:07:08.294 --> 00:07:11.196
- I do not know.


00:07:11.229 --> 00:07:13.298
It will be quite dangerous.


00:07:13.331 --> 00:07:15.100
- I have faith in my abilities.


00:07:15.133 --> 00:07:16.901
- No doubt you have
faith in your abilities


00:07:16.934 --> 00:07:18.836
to deceive the insanity experts,


00:07:18.869 --> 00:07:21.539
I fear they cannot be deceived.


00:07:21.572 --> 00:07:23.973
- I will teach myself to be mad.


00:07:24.006 --> 00:07:26.276
- It is vital that
you not be revealed,


00:07:26.309 --> 00:07:28.410
your very life
may be threatened.


00:07:28.443 --> 00:07:30.145
- I am not afraid of danger.


00:07:30.178 --> 00:07:31.947
- And how do we truly
test the competency


00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:35.116
of the doctors and nurses.


00:07:35.149 --> 00:07:36.851
- The answer is simple,


00:07:36.884 --> 00:07:39.352
I will be insane long
enough to get committed,


00:07:39.385 --> 00:07:42.889
but from the moment I enter
the insane ward on the island,


00:07:42.922 --> 00:07:47.026
I will talk and act just
as I do in ordinary life.


00:07:49.161 --> 00:07:51.329
Then it is decided.


00:07:53.931 --> 00:07:56.034
- It is decided.


00:07:56.067 --> 00:07:58.569
- I shall feign insanity
have myself committed


00:07:58.602 --> 00:08:00.838
to Blackwell's Lunatic Asylum.


00:08:00.871 --> 00:08:02.572
Yes.


00:08:02.605 --> 00:08:04.574
Uh, just one more thing.


00:08:04.607 --> 00:08:05.975
- What is it?


00:08:06.008 --> 00:08:08.610
- I am afraid of that
chronic smile of yours.


00:08:08.643 --> 00:08:12.080
- I will smile no more.


00:08:21.554 --> 00:08:23.289
- After
receiving my instructions,


00:08:23.322 --> 00:08:24.924
I returned to my boarding house.


00:08:24.957 --> 00:08:26.124
And in front of the mirror,


00:08:26.157 --> 00:08:29.394
I began to practice the role
in which I was to make my debut


00:08:29.427 --> 00:08:32.564
to convince the world
that I was insane.


00:09:09.227 --> 00:09:10.996
I turned the gas up high,


00:09:11.029 --> 00:09:12.997
in hopes that it
would raise my courage


00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:14.899
against the thought that
I about to be locked away


00:09:14.932 --> 00:09:18.368
in a mad house, with no
clear way to get out.


00:09:41.687 --> 00:09:43.389
I quietly bathed fair well


00:09:43.422 --> 00:09:46.258
to the precious comforts
of modern civilization.


00:09:48.225 --> 00:09:50.128
It may be for days.


00:09:50.161 --> 00:09:52.129
It may be for longer.


00:09:52.162 --> 00:09:55.399
I took a last fond look
at myself as a sane woman.


00:09:55.432 --> 00:09:58.034
Who could tell, but that
the strain of playing crazy


00:09:58.067 --> 00:10:00.069
might burn my own brain


00:10:00.102 --> 00:10:02.338
and I would never get back.


00:10:06.174 --> 00:10:08.410
I decided to start my
mission at a temporary home


00:10:08.443 --> 00:10:11.412
for working women.


00:10:11.445 --> 00:10:13.547
My objective was to make
this house full of women


00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:15.281
believe me crazy,


00:10:15.314 --> 00:10:18.384
so they would never rest
until I was out of there reach


00:10:18.417 --> 00:10:21.053
and in secure quartets.


00:10:22.487 --> 00:10:24.523
- Well what do you want?


00:10:24.556 --> 00:10:26.657
- I want to stay
here for a few days,


00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:28.993
if you can accommodate me.


00:10:29.026 --> 00:10:31.429
- Well I have no single
rooms, we are so crowded.


00:10:31.462 --> 00:10:33.430
But if you will occupy a
room with another girl,


00:10:33.463 --> 00:10:34.631
I shall grant you that much.


00:10:34.664 --> 00:10:36.299
- I shall be glad of that.


00:10:36.332 --> 00:10:37.634
How much do you charge?


00:10:37.667 --> 00:10:41.337
- Thirty cents a night.


00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:50.611
Move along.


00:10:54.347 --> 00:10:57.049
So now I was
amongst these honest workers,


00:10:57.082 --> 00:10:58.718
the most deserving of women.


00:10:58.751 --> 00:11:01.686
I selected them as the ones
to work out my salvation,


00:11:01.719 --> 00:11:04.122
or more properly speaking,


00:11:04.155 --> 00:11:07.491
my condemnation and conviction
into the insane asylum.


00:11:14.497 --> 00:11:16.699
- Shhh.


00:11:16.732 --> 00:11:19.001
Shhh!


00:11:19.034 --> 00:11:19.768
Shhh!


00:11:37.049 --> 00:11:38.584
- What's wrong with you?


00:11:38.617 --> 00:11:40.419
Have you some
sorrow or troubled?


00:11:40.452 --> 00:11:42.453
- No why?


00:11:42.486 --> 00:11:46.457
- Oh because I can
see it in your face.


00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:50.127
What kind of work are
you trying to get?


00:11:51.661 --> 00:11:54.363
- I never worked,
I don't know how.


00:11:54.396 --> 00:11:57.567
- But you must learn,
all these women work.


00:11:59.133 --> 00:12:02.203
- Do they?


00:12:02.236 --> 00:12:05.672
Oh why they all
look horrible to me.


00:12:05.705 --> 00:12:10.209
Just like crazy women.


00:12:10.242 --> 00:12:13.279
There's so many
crazy people about.


00:12:20.618 --> 00:12:22.219
It
was amusing to see


00:12:22.252 --> 00:12:24.388
what remarkably short time it
took to get up from her chair


00:12:24.421 --> 00:12:27.223
and hurriedly move away
from the crazy girl.


00:12:27.256 --> 00:12:28.658
I knew my performance
had hit home.


00:12:42.536 --> 00:12:44.272
- So I said to the supervisor,


00:12:44.305 --> 00:12:46.640
that it's just not right
to keep this place so cold.


00:12:46.673 --> 00:12:49.142
I mean if they want
us to produce faster,


00:12:49.175 --> 00:12:51.143
they really ought to invest
in a couple sticks of wood


00:12:51.176 --> 00:12:54.547
for the stove, don't you agree?


00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.549
- I don't know, I cannot say.


00:12:57.582 --> 00:13:01.720
Oh yes, I mean no, I don't know.


00:13:02.686 --> 00:13:05.689
Oh is it suddenly hot in here?


00:13:05.722 --> 00:13:08.691
I know nothing about
the boats to Boston.


00:13:08.724 --> 00:13:11.160
I have to find my trunks!


00:13:11.193 --> 00:13:13.562
- It's time for bed ladies.


00:13:14.629 --> 00:13:16.164
- Oh I'm afraid.


00:13:16.197 --> 00:13:17.299
Can I not sit by
the stairs tonight?


00:13:17.332 --> 00:13:18.667
- No!


00:13:20.501 --> 00:13:26.239
Everyone in the house will
think that you're crazy.


00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:31.510
- This way Miss Brown.


00:13:31.543 --> 00:13:35.114
- No, this is my room.


00:13:35.147 --> 00:13:36.814
I will not stay with
that crazy woman


00:13:36.847 --> 00:13:38.783
for all the money
in the Vanderbelts.


00:13:38.816 --> 00:13:40.585
My
act was working.


00:13:40.618 --> 00:13:43.720
The women were afraid of me.


00:13:43.753 --> 00:13:45.622
- I can't have her
scaring you all off.


00:13:45.655 --> 00:13:46.656
I'll send for a policeman


00:13:46.689 --> 00:13:48.224
and have her taken away at once.


00:13:48.257 --> 00:13:50.226
Go fetch a policeman
from the corner.


00:13:50.259 --> 00:13:52.728
- No she can stay in my room.


00:13:52.761 --> 00:13:55.396
- There's only one bed, I don't
have time to set up another.


00:13:55.429 --> 00:13:56.731
- That'll be fine.


00:13:56.764 --> 00:13:58.233
- Only this
one woman among the crowd,


00:13:58.266 --> 00:13:59.633
pretty and delicate
Mrs. Caine...


00:13:59.666 --> 00:14:01.168
- Suit yourself.


00:14:01.201 --> 00:14:06.506
- Displayed
true compassionate feeling.


00:14:10.809 --> 00:14:12.410
She smoothed my hair


00:14:12.443 --> 00:14:14.679
and talked as soothingly
to me as a mother would do


00:14:14.712 --> 00:14:15.881
to a sick child.


00:14:15.914 --> 00:14:18.682
- I don't remember
much about my mother,


00:14:18.715 --> 00:14:23.486
but I always remember her
combing through my hair


00:14:23.519 --> 00:14:26.323
and getting me ready for bed.


00:14:29.891 --> 00:14:31.793
Let's get you out of that
dress and ready for bed.


00:14:31.826 --> 00:14:33.462
- No!


00:14:35.362 --> 00:14:36.697
They're going to kill me.


00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.900
- Who's going to kill you?


00:14:38.933 --> 00:14:40.333
- I will not take off my dress.


00:14:40.366 --> 00:14:41.635
- Perhaps if you just
lie down on the bed


00:14:41.668 --> 00:14:42.636
with your clothes on...


00:14:42.669 --> 00:14:43.804
- No!


00:14:45.537 --> 00:14:47.773
- Here look, I will
lie down on the bed


00:14:47.806 --> 00:14:50.276
with my clothes on as
well, be ready with you.


00:14:50.309 --> 00:14:54.813
- I will not.


00:14:59.282 --> 00:15:03.686
- Do try to rest dear.


00:15:21.534 --> 00:15:26.371
- You're still awake,
lively as a cricket.


00:15:26.404 --> 00:15:29.241
- I have to find my luggage.


00:15:29.274 --> 00:15:30.842
- Oh dear, you have been
up on your feet all night,


00:15:30.875 --> 00:15:32.476
you must be exhausted.


00:15:32.509 --> 00:15:35.279
Though Mrs. Caine
grew more and more anxious..


00:15:35.312 --> 00:15:36.747
- Sit and rest poor thing.


00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:40.550
She was
as sympathetic as ever.


00:15:40.583 --> 00:15:43.552
Poor soul, how cruelly
I tortured her.


00:15:43.585 --> 00:15:45.287
- I have trunks.


00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:47.289
Where are they? I want them.


00:15:47.322 --> 00:15:48.490
I want them.


00:15:48.523 --> 00:15:51.426
And what
a kind heart she had.


00:15:51.459 --> 00:15:53.261
- I'll see if there's
any more of them.


00:16:07.605 --> 00:16:10.642
- How much I admired
her courage and kindness,


00:16:10.675 --> 00:16:11.843
how I longed to reassure her


00:16:11.876 --> 00:16:14.812
and whisper that
I was not insane.


00:16:14.845 --> 00:16:16.880
How I hoped that
if any poor girl


00:16:16.913 --> 00:16:18.715
should ever be so
unfortunate as to be


00:16:18.748 --> 00:16:20.350
what I was pretending to be...


00:16:20.383 --> 00:16:21.484
- Poor child.


00:16:21.517 --> 00:16:22.685
She
might meet with one


00:16:22.718 --> 00:16:25.420
who possessed the same
spirit of human kindness


00:16:25.453 --> 00:16:26.889
as Mrs. Ruth Caine.


00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:33.394
- Yes I believe the
poor dear is insane.


00:16:42.567 --> 00:16:43.869
- I want you to
take her quietly.


00:16:43.902 --> 00:16:45.604
- If she don't go quietly,


00:16:45.637 --> 00:16:46.971
I will drag her
through the streets.


00:16:47.004 --> 00:16:49.707
- I certainly wish to avoid
raising a scandal outside.


00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:51.409
- There's no need for
that kind of brutality.


00:16:51.442 --> 00:16:52.876
- I'll handle this.


00:16:52.909 --> 00:16:55.646
We'll take her along quietly.


00:16:56.613 --> 00:16:58.514
Well hello there sweet girl.


00:16:58.547 --> 00:16:59.749
If you would like
to come with me,


00:16:59.782 --> 00:17:02.351
I'll help you find
your lost effects.


00:17:02.384 --> 00:17:03.653
- Who are you?


00:17:03.686 --> 00:17:04.886
I don't know you.


00:17:04.919 --> 00:17:06.655
- He's a policeman love.


00:17:06.688 --> 00:17:07.822
He means you no harm,


00:17:07.855 --> 00:17:10.491
he's going to help
you find your things.


00:17:10.524 --> 00:17:12.993
- I don't want to
go with him alone.


00:17:13.026 --> 00:17:14.528
I do not know him.


00:17:14.561 --> 00:17:16.496
- You don't have to go with
him if you don't want to.


00:17:16.529 --> 00:17:18.598
- I will help you
find your trunks.


00:17:18.631 --> 00:17:21.034
We can find them together.


00:17:21.066 --> 00:17:22.501
- You will?


00:17:22.534 --> 00:17:24.603
- Of course, they couldn't
have got very far.


00:17:24.636 --> 00:17:25.671
Now you just come along with me.


00:17:34.677 --> 00:17:36.913
Follow us at a
respectable distance.


00:17:36.946 --> 00:17:43.519
- These policeman
are here to help you.


00:17:51.424 --> 00:17:53.060
The
skies were overcast


00:17:53.093 --> 00:17:56.062
as I was taken to the
S6 Market Police Court.


00:17:56.095 --> 00:17:58.597
Where at last, the
question of my sanity,


00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:01.433
or insanity was to be decided.


00:18:01.466 --> 00:18:03.335
- Sir, sir, please help me sir.


00:18:03.368 --> 00:18:04.436
- Step back.


00:18:04.469 --> 00:18:06.338
- Here's the express house.


00:18:06.371 --> 00:18:08.639
We're all here to help
you find your trunks.


00:18:08.672 --> 00:18:11.008
- All these people
lost their trunks?


00:18:11.041 --> 00:18:13.676
- Yes apparently all of
them have lost their trunks.


00:18:13.709 --> 00:18:15.545
- I don't know what
to do with the child.


00:18:15.578 --> 00:18:16.813
She must be taken care of.


00:18:16.846 --> 00:18:17.780
Send
her to the island.


00:18:17.813 --> 00:18:19.815
- No, oh don't, don't.


00:18:19.848 --> 00:18:23.018
She is a lady, it would kill
her to go to the island.


00:18:23.051 --> 00:18:24.719
- Perhaps you're right.


00:18:24.752 --> 00:18:27.088
There is some foul work here,


00:18:27.121 --> 00:18:31.524
I believe this girl has been
drugged and brought to the city


00:18:31.557 --> 00:18:32.826
make out the papers,


00:18:32.859 --> 00:18:35.562
we'll send her to
Belview for examination.


00:18:35.595 --> 00:18:36.995
And probably in a few days,


00:18:37.028 --> 00:18:38.630
the effect of the
drug will wear off


00:18:38.663 --> 00:18:41.633
and she'll be able to tell us
a story that'll be startling.


00:18:41.666 --> 00:18:44.836
- I do not wish to stay here
any longer to be gazed at.


00:18:44.869 --> 00:18:49.740
- Take her to my office.


00:18:54.009 --> 00:18:56.445
- Put out your tongue.


00:18:57.813 --> 00:18:59.581
I said put out your tongue.


00:18:59.614 --> 00:19:00.882
- I don't want to.


00:19:00.915 --> 00:19:02.650
- But you are sick
and I am a doctor.


00:19:02.683 --> 00:19:07.021
- I am not sick, I
just want my trunks.


00:19:11.724 --> 00:19:18.997
- Open.


00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:24.735
Take a deep breath.


00:19:34.509 --> 00:19:35.744
Alright.


00:19:35.777 --> 00:19:37.613
Look at my hand.


00:19:40.681 --> 00:19:43.017
Follow my hand.


00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:47.688
And again.


00:19:51.657 --> 00:19:52.992
I believe she's
taken Belladonna.


00:19:53.025 --> 00:19:54.794
- I'm not in the least ill.


00:19:54.827 --> 00:19:56.995
I've never been sick and no
one has the right to detain me


00:19:57.028 --> 00:19:59.931
when I want to find my trunks.


00:19:59.964 --> 00:20:01.433
I want to go home.


00:20:01.466 --> 00:20:03.901
- And I will take you home.


00:20:05.802 --> 00:20:07.905
- I am so glad to go with you.


00:20:07.938 --> 00:20:09.505
I began
to have more confidence


00:20:09.538 --> 00:20:11.908
in my own ability to
play a mad woman now,


00:20:11.941 --> 00:20:14.776
since one judge, one
doctor, and a mass of people


00:20:14.809 --> 00:20:16.812
had pronounced me insane.


00:20:20.981 --> 00:20:22.483
I shall never forget that ride


00:20:22.516 --> 00:20:24.685
to the insane pavilion
at Belview Hospital.


00:20:26.752 --> 00:20:28.788
It was at the hospital
that I was to be processed


00:20:28.821 --> 00:20:31.523
and my fate sealed
regarding my commitment


00:20:31.556 --> 00:20:33.526
to Blackwell's Island Asylum.


00:20:35.193 --> 00:20:37.595
- This girl is to wait here.


00:20:40.965 --> 00:20:42.633
- Oh please do not go.


00:20:42.666 --> 00:20:45.469
Please do not leave
me here, I beg you.


00:20:45.502 --> 00:20:47.838
Oh take me with you.


00:20:47.871 --> 00:20:49.939
You said that you
would take me home.


00:20:49.972 --> 00:20:53.776
- I have to assist
with an amputation.


00:20:56.244 --> 00:20:58.547
- Those noisy commoners.


00:21:02.015 --> 00:21:04.051
- I do not want to
stay here without you.


00:21:04.084 --> 00:21:05.586
- I'll be back soon, I promise.


00:21:05.619 --> 00:21:07.119
- To take me home?


00:21:07.152 --> 00:21:08.554
- Yes.


00:21:08.587 --> 00:21:10.223
At last, I
found myself an occupant


00:21:10.256 --> 00:21:12.090
of an insane asylum.


00:21:14.659 --> 00:21:17.595
I already felt like
a woman condemned.


00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:22.733
- Hello, I'd like
to introduce myself.


00:21:22.766 --> 00:21:24.935
My name is Nellie Brown.


00:21:28.604 --> 00:21:30.239
I'm here waiting for
a nice gentleman,


00:21:30.272 --> 00:21:35.743
who is going to
come take me home.


00:21:40.047 --> 00:21:44.485
- I'm Ann Neville.


00:21:48.020 --> 00:21:50.990
This is not a place
that you want wait long,


00:21:51.023 --> 00:21:53.825
if you don't need to be here.


00:21:53.858 --> 00:21:56.728
This is a place of the sick.


00:21:56.761 --> 00:21:58.862
- Are you sick?


00:21:58.895 --> 00:22:00.197
- Yes.


00:22:04.233 --> 00:22:06.168
- How did you come to be here?


00:22:06.201 --> 00:22:10.138
- I was working as a chamber
maid in a large house,


00:22:10.171 --> 00:22:11.940
when my health gave away.


00:22:11.973 --> 00:22:15.042
I was sent to a sister's
home to be treated.


00:22:15.075 --> 00:22:18.012
My nephew is out of work.


00:22:18.045 --> 00:22:21.581
Being unable to pay my
expenses at my home,


00:22:21.614 --> 00:22:24.551
he had me transferred
here to Belview.


00:22:32.157 --> 00:22:34.892
- Is there anything
wrong with you mentally?


00:22:34.925 --> 00:22:36.294
- No.


00:22:37.861 --> 00:22:41.131
The doctors have been asking
me many dubious questions


00:22:41.164 --> 00:22:43.199
and confusing me,


00:22:43.232 --> 00:22:47.069
but there's nothing
wrong with my brain.


00:22:47.102 --> 00:22:48.837
- Do you know that
only insane people


00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:49.904
are sent to this pavilion?


00:22:49.937 --> 00:22:53.775
- Yes, I know.


00:22:53.808 --> 00:22:56.243
But the doctors refuse
to listen to me,


00:22:56.276 --> 00:22:59.680
it's useless to say
anything to the nurses.


00:23:03.949 --> 00:23:06.185
- Let me hold the baby.


00:23:43.348 --> 00:23:45.184
- Nellie Brown,
the doctor is here.


00:23:45.217 --> 00:23:47.319
He wishes to speak with you.


00:23:51.122 --> 00:23:52.990
- How are you feeling Nellie?


00:23:54.424 --> 00:23:58.061
- Oh I feel alright.


00:23:58.094 --> 00:24:00.663
But you
are sick you know?


00:24:00.696 --> 00:24:01.330
- Am I?


00:24:01.363 --> 00:24:02.932
- Yes.


00:24:02.965 --> 00:24:05.066
Tell me why did you think the
women in the temporary home


00:24:05.099 --> 00:24:06.301
were going to harm you.


00:24:06.334 --> 00:24:08.737
- Temporary home, I...


00:24:08.770 --> 00:24:10.204
What temporary home?


00:24:10.237 --> 00:24:11.805
- You did not stay in a temporary home for working women?


00:24:11.838 --> 00:24:14.808
- No, I've never
stayed in such a place.


00:24:14.841 --> 00:24:16.843
- What was the name of the
judge presiding over your case?


00:24:16.876 --> 00:24:19.345
- I do not remember going
in front of a judge.


00:24:19.378 --> 00:24:22.381
- I see, what is
your father's name?


00:24:26.418 --> 00:24:28.219
- I cannot remember.


00:24:28.252 --> 00:24:29.988
- What is your mother's name?


00:24:32.990 --> 00:24:34.224
- I cannot remember.


00:24:34.257 --> 00:24:37.093
- Any brothers or
sisters, aunts or uncles?


00:24:37.126 --> 00:24:38.228
- I cannot remember.


00:24:38.261 --> 00:24:40.095
- Calm down Miss
Brown, calm down.


00:24:40.128 --> 00:24:41.931
It's fine.


00:24:43.932 --> 00:24:48.036
Do you not have a lover
that casts you aside?


00:24:48.069 --> 00:24:49.237
- No.


00:24:49.270 --> 00:24:50.238
- Now what street was
the temporary home,


00:24:50.271 --> 00:24:51.938
you stayed at, located?


00:24:51.971 --> 00:24:54.274
- I did not stay at
any temporary home!


00:24:54.307 --> 00:24:56.375
- Alright, that's
fine Miss Brown.


00:24:56.408 --> 00:24:59.078
Try to get some rest, alright.


00:25:03.347 --> 00:25:04.416
Not once,


00:25:04.449 --> 00:25:05.817
did it cross the
admitting doctor's mind


00:25:05.850 --> 00:25:07.751
that I might not be
telling him the truth.


00:25:07.784 --> 00:25:09.253
Based on such an examination,


00:25:09.286 --> 00:25:10.754
I doubt any doctor could tell


00:25:10.787 --> 00:25:13.257
whether people
are insane or not.


00:25:28.135 --> 00:25:30.271
- Ow, ah!


00:25:30.304 --> 00:25:33.406
Ow, ow, you are trimming
my nails to the quick.


00:25:33.439 --> 00:25:36.109
- It is for everyone's safety.


00:25:37.976 --> 00:25:39.478
- Miss Scott, Miss Scott,


00:25:39.511 --> 00:25:41.880
there's a gentleman here
from the Sun Newspaper


00:25:41.913 --> 00:25:43.214
to interview Miss Brown.


00:25:43.247 --> 00:25:46.150
- No one is to see
the transfer patients.


00:25:46.183 --> 00:25:48.218
- I had to
summon all of my courage,


00:25:48.251 --> 00:25:51.788
as I was marched to the
boat to Blackwell's Asylum;


00:25:51.821 --> 00:25:55.324
an insane place, where
women never get out.


00:26:31.954 --> 00:26:37.359
- Come with me.


00:26:45.166 --> 00:26:47.934
- Feet flat on the
floor at all times.


00:26:57.842 --> 00:27:00.178
- Voiceover] It's strange
how after all of my bravery,


00:27:00.211 --> 00:27:02.947
I felt a chill at being locked
up with fellow creatures,


00:27:02.980 --> 00:27:04.815
who were truly insane.


00:27:04.848 --> 00:27:11.521
Come here to bed.


00:27:15.924 --> 00:27:18.493
- I had recently been ill.


00:27:18.526 --> 00:27:21.495
It lasted so long, I suffered
from nervous stability.


00:27:21.528 --> 00:27:25.166
But I only had fever
thinking, while I was ill.


00:27:26.532 --> 00:27:28.434
I do not belong here.


00:27:28.467 --> 00:27:30.837
I have recovered.


00:27:30.870 --> 00:27:33.972
- I will decide your diagnosis.


00:27:34.005 --> 00:27:35.374
- Please,


00:27:35.407 --> 00:27:38.876
try all your tests for
insanity if you have any,


00:27:38.909 --> 00:27:40.545
I do not belong here.


00:27:40.578 --> 00:27:42.413
- Everyone who enters
here makes that claim.


00:27:42.446 --> 00:27:44.514
- Please give me justice.


00:27:44.547 --> 00:27:46.516
- Justice?


00:27:46.549 --> 00:27:48.251
- Justice refers to the law,


00:27:48.284 --> 00:27:51.854
you speak as if you're
entering a prison.


00:27:51.887 --> 00:27:53.856
But this is a hospital,


00:27:53.889 --> 00:27:55.323
we're here to help you.


00:27:55.356 --> 00:27:57.926
- Please, I beg you.


00:27:57.959 --> 00:27:59.994
You not need worry Miss Mayard,


00:28:00.027 --> 00:28:02.963
we'll get you the help you need.


00:28:09.268 --> 00:28:11.003
- I'm so frightened.


00:28:11.036 --> 00:28:12.337
He didn't listen to me at all.


00:28:12.370 --> 00:28:14.005
Mrs. Louise Shanz.


00:28:14.038 --> 00:28:17.142
- I will try by every means
to be a benefit to you.


00:28:17.175 --> 00:28:19.911
- What can you do?


00:28:22.379 --> 00:28:24.514
- Doctor please, you do
not understand what...


00:28:24.547 --> 00:28:28.284
You're name?


00:28:30.986 --> 00:28:33.455
- Miss Grupe, you're German.


00:28:33.488 --> 00:28:36.825
Ask her what her husband does.


00:28:43.096 --> 00:28:47.900
- Her husband is a craftsman.


00:28:49.034 --> 00:28:50.336
- Very well.


00:28:50.369 --> 00:28:52.037
Mrs. Louise Schanz is admitted


00:28:52.070 --> 00:28:53.171
to Blackwell's
Island Insane Asylum.


00:28:53.204 --> 00:28:55.139
- No this is not right.


00:29:08.217 --> 00:29:09.519
- Miss Anne Neville.


00:29:10.652 --> 00:29:12.487
- Can you tell me your name?


00:29:12.520 --> 00:29:14.189
- Yes.


00:29:15.989 --> 00:29:16.924
- What is it?


00:29:16.957 --> 00:29:21.294
- You don't know or are
you seeing if I know?


00:29:24.664 --> 00:29:26.466
What are you writing?


00:29:26.499 --> 00:29:27.900
- I ask the questions.


00:29:27.933 --> 00:29:29.301
Like the others,


00:29:29.334 --> 00:29:32.638
the poor girl was condemned
to the insane asylum for life.


00:29:32.671 --> 00:29:34.138
- Anne Neville.


00:29:34.171 --> 00:29:35.106
- Without being
given one feeble chance


00:29:35.139 --> 00:29:36.274
to prove her sanity.


00:29:36.307 --> 00:29:39.376
- Nellie Brown the
doctor wants you.


00:29:39.409 --> 00:29:41.378
- As
according to my plan,


00:29:41.411 --> 00:29:43.313
the moment I
entered Blackwell's,


00:29:43.346 --> 00:29:45.514
I dropped my act of insanity


00:29:45.547 --> 00:29:48.050
and acted just as I
do in every day life.


00:29:48.083 --> 00:29:49.585
What is your name?


00:29:49.618 --> 00:29:51.553
- Nellie Brown.


00:29:53.554 --> 00:29:55.923
- What's the color of her eyes?


00:29:55.956 --> 00:29:57.258
- Gray.


00:29:58.158 --> 00:30:00.027
What is your age?


00:30:00.060 --> 00:30:02.495
- Nineteen last may.


00:30:05.564 --> 00:30:07.599
- When do you get
your next pass?


00:30:07.632 --> 00:30:10.001
- Next Saturday is
my next day off.


00:30:10.034 --> 00:30:11.269
- You will go into town?


00:30:11.302 --> 00:30:14.338
Yeah.


00:30:14.371 --> 00:30:19.542
- Measure her.


00:30:24.146 --> 00:30:25.915
What is it?


00:30:28.650 --> 00:30:30.352
- Now you know I can't tell.


00:30:30.385 --> 00:30:32.420
- Yes you can, now
look and tell me.


00:30:32.453 --> 00:30:34.522
- I can't, do it yourself.


00:30:46.732 --> 00:30:49.400
- Five feet, five inches.


00:30:49.433 --> 00:30:52.036
Don't you see?


00:30:52.069 --> 00:30:55.572
- Oh yeah, I see now.


00:30:59.209 --> 00:31:01.077
- Now...


00:31:03.579 --> 00:31:06.548
That will do, I'm
finished with her.


00:31:09.684 --> 00:31:12.519
- I am not sick and I do
not want to stay here.


00:31:12.552 --> 00:31:14.188
- That'll do Miss Gruper.


00:31:14.221 --> 00:31:17.056
- No one has a right to
shut me up in this manner.


00:31:23.428 --> 00:31:25.965
- Bath time single file!


00:31:26.464 --> 00:31:27.766
Girl undress.


00:31:27.799 --> 00:31:29.500
- I think I shall not.


00:31:29.533 --> 00:31:32.036
I've never bathed in this
manner in front of others.


00:31:32.069 --> 00:31:34.504
And it is too cold
to bathe tonight.


00:31:34.537 --> 00:31:37.073
Why can't we wait until
day time when it is warm?


00:31:37.106 --> 00:31:39.742
- Nellie Brown, either you
remove your clothing right now


00:31:39.775 --> 00:31:42.211
or we will undress you.


00:31:46.080 --> 00:31:47.548
Very well.


00:31:47.581 --> 00:31:52.052
Miss Grupe.


00:32:04.162 --> 00:32:06.665
- No, no.


00:32:11.134 --> 00:32:15.372
I will not remove it.


00:32:20.075 --> 00:32:21.677
No.


00:32:37.189 --> 00:32:39.458
It's so cold, I cannot stand it.


00:32:42.160 --> 00:32:44.696
No, no my hair,
please no my hair.


00:33:13.619 --> 00:33:15.188
- Next.


00:33:16.789 --> 00:33:18.824
I'm ill, I
have been sick with a cough.


00:33:18.857 --> 00:33:22.428
My chest, I cannot
get into cold water.


00:33:32.235 --> 00:33:33.536
- Can no one hear her?


00:33:33.569 --> 00:33:36.738
She's ill, she's not well
enough for cold water.


00:33:36.771 --> 00:33:39.842
- Please,
please my head is been hurt.


00:33:39.875 --> 00:33:42.610
My hair is falling out.


00:33:46.779 --> 00:33:48.281
- May I have a nightgown?


00:33:48.314 --> 00:33:50.550
- We have not such things
in this institution.


00:33:50.583 --> 00:33:51.785
- I'm still wet from the bath


00:33:51.818 --> 00:33:53.452
and I shouldn't like
to sleep without one.


00:33:53.485 --> 00:33:54.787
- This is charity


00:33:54.820 --> 00:33:56.689
and you should be
thankful for what you get.


00:33:56.722 --> 00:33:59.390
- But the city pays to
keep these places up


00:33:59.423 --> 00:34:02.494
and pays people to be kind to
the unfortunates brought here.


00:34:02.527 --> 00:34:05.729
- Well you don't need to
expect any kindness here,


00:34:05.762 --> 00:34:08.565
for you won't get it.


00:34:24.444 --> 00:34:26.780
- Brown, get up.


00:34:27.413 --> 00:34:28.348
Drink this.


00:34:28.381 --> 00:34:29.549
- What is it?


00:34:29.582 --> 00:34:31.184
- It's something
to help you sleep.


00:34:31.217 --> 00:34:31.851
- What's in it?


00:34:31.884 --> 00:34:33.652
- It's Laudannum.


00:34:33.685 --> 00:34:35.621
- Is that not an opium mixture?


00:34:35.654 --> 00:34:37.523
- Yes it
will help you sleep.


00:34:37.556 --> 00:34:38.723
- I'm not going to take opium.


00:34:38.756 --> 00:34:40.625
- The doctor has ordered
it, you must take it.


00:34:40.658 --> 00:34:44.128
- I will do nothing of the sort.


00:34:44.661 --> 00:34:45.896
- Hello Miss Brown.


00:34:45.929 --> 00:34:48.532
Refusing your medication?


00:34:48.565 --> 00:34:51.634
- It is opium, I do
not wish to take opium.


00:34:51.667 --> 00:34:53.502
- Nearly all the
patients take it.


00:34:53.535 --> 00:34:55.503
- I'm not going to take it.


00:34:55.536 --> 00:34:58.439
I do not intend to lose my
wits, even for a few hours.


00:34:58.472 --> 00:34:59.607
- If you do not take it,


00:34:59.640 --> 00:35:05.513
I will put it in your
arm with a needle.


00:35:09.782 --> 00:35:10.850
- This smells horrible.


00:35:10.883 --> 00:35:12.784
- I insist you drink
it all the same.


00:35:36.704 --> 00:35:38.406
- I thought
of Robert Bruce,


00:35:38.439 --> 00:35:40.274
the warrior who led
Scotland during the wars


00:35:40.307 --> 00:35:41.775
of independence.


00:35:41.808 --> 00:35:44.678
In his captivity, he found
confidence from a spider


00:35:44.711 --> 00:35:46.479
building her web across
the roof of his cell,


00:35:47.512 --> 00:35:51.817
undeterred by failure.


00:36:00.824 --> 00:36:02.193
- She's quite mad.


00:36:30.649 --> 00:36:33.684
- You may have my bread.


00:36:33.717 --> 00:36:37.855
- Thank you kindly, but
I will ask the nurse.


00:36:37.888 --> 00:36:41.325
- Excuse me may I have
a second piece of bread.


00:36:43.426 --> 00:36:44.527
- You have forgotten
where your home is,


00:36:44.560 --> 00:36:47.863
but you have not
forgotten how to eat.


00:36:47.896 --> 00:36:48.831
- Thank you.


00:37:07.413 --> 00:37:08.647
- Give me that.


00:37:10.048 --> 00:37:10.915
- To have a good mind,


00:37:10.948 --> 00:37:12.484
the stomach must be fed.


00:37:12.517 --> 00:37:14.518
- I cannot eat this stuff.


00:37:16.687 --> 00:37:19.822
- Patients wait
and transfer here,


00:37:19.855 --> 00:37:23.593
such as these, until the
staff can be allocated


00:37:23.626 --> 00:37:27.729
to move them onto
their daily activities.


00:37:27.762 --> 00:37:30.065
- When was Blackwell's
first opened?


00:37:30.098 --> 00:37:33.601
- The facility
was opened in 1839


00:37:33.634 --> 00:37:36.304
and quickly overrun
with patients.


00:37:36.337 --> 00:37:40.840
It has been in continuous
operations since then.


00:37:40.873 --> 00:37:43.909
Blackwell's was designed
by the faint architect,


00:37:43.942 --> 00:37:47.079
Alexander Jackson Davis.


00:37:47.112 --> 00:37:49.847
The facility was
constructed of granite,


00:37:49.880 --> 00:37:53.484
reflecting a feudal
style of architecture,


00:37:53.517 --> 00:37:55.752
with it's more than
large appearance.


00:37:55.785 --> 00:37:59.656
It's stands 600 feet long.


00:37:59.689 --> 00:38:02.825
Wit the proper
funding and guidance,


00:38:02.858 --> 00:38:06.528
Blackwell"s will one
day be a Utopian example


00:38:06.561 --> 00:38:10.665
of the most advanced
treatment of the insane.


00:38:10.698 --> 00:38:12.466
We have worked miracles


00:38:12.499 --> 00:38:15.803
with limited funding
available to us.


00:38:16.804 --> 00:38:20.073
Now you can see why we
need additional funding.


00:38:20.106 --> 00:38:23.709
Gentleman, please come this way.


00:38:27.679 --> 00:38:29.647
The
snow came early,


00:38:29.680 --> 00:38:31.615
many windows in the
hall were broken,


00:38:31.648 --> 00:38:34.385
and the bitter cold
air was unbearable.


00:38:34.417 --> 00:38:35.885
There was no heat.


00:38:35.918 --> 00:38:38.822
The nurses said it was one of
the rules of the institution,


00:38:38.855 --> 00:38:41.757
not to turn the heat
on until October


00:38:41.790 --> 00:38:43.625
and so we would
have to endure it,


00:38:43.658 --> 00:38:46.861
as the steam pipes had not
even been put in order.


00:38:50.498 --> 00:38:52.799
- How did you sleep
after your cold bath?


00:38:52.832 --> 00:38:54.768
- I almost froze


00:38:54.801 --> 00:38:58.804
and then the noise kept
me awake, it's dreadful.


00:38:58.837 --> 00:39:01.574
My nerves were so unstrung
before I came here


00:39:01.607 --> 00:39:05.009
and I fear I shall not be
able to stand the strain.


00:39:05.042 --> 00:39:07.045
- You must keep your spirits up.


00:39:07.078 --> 00:39:09.113
You never know what is to come.


00:39:09.146 --> 00:39:10.814
And if you give up now,


00:39:10.847 --> 00:39:13.484
the good may arrive and
you will not know it.


00:39:13.517 --> 00:39:14.917
- You are right of course.


00:39:14.950 --> 00:39:16.152
- Miss Tillie
Mayard suffered more


00:39:16.185 --> 00:39:18.521
than any of us from the cold.


00:39:18.554 --> 00:39:21.456
I asked the nurses that we
given additional clothing,


00:39:21.489 --> 00:39:22.991
but they told me to shut up.


00:39:23.024 --> 00:39:25.394
That we had as much as
they intended to give us.


00:39:25.427 --> 00:39:27.995
- Matilda I'll tell you
who has taken your money.


00:39:28.028 --> 00:39:30.064
- Who then, who do
you say has my money?


00:39:30.097 --> 00:39:36.837
- Come close and I'll tell you.


00:39:41.206 --> 00:39:42.608
- Who then, who?


00:39:42.641 --> 00:39:44.008
Please tell me so I
can collect my money


00:39:44.041 --> 00:39:45.843
and pay my way
out of this place.


00:39:45.876 --> 00:39:47.412
- It is Nurse Grupe.


00:39:47.445 --> 00:39:49.913
You must go to her and tell
her she is a thieving whore


00:39:49.946 --> 00:39:51.148
and you want your money


00:39:51.181 --> 00:39:53.850
or you will gouge her eyes out.


00:39:53.883 --> 00:39:57.019
Go to her, go, go
now and tell her.


00:40:00.622 --> 00:40:01.423
- Miss Grupe?


00:40:01.456 --> 00:40:03.024
- Yes Matilda?


00:40:03.057 --> 00:40:07.961
- Miss Grady says that
she is a thieving whore.


00:40:13.065 --> 00:40:14.500
- Matilda!


00:40:14.533 --> 00:40:16.770
Come here to me.


00:40:23.907 --> 00:40:27.912
Now return to your radiator.


00:40:27.945 --> 00:40:30.013
The lawyers that
stole your estate


00:40:30.046 --> 00:40:33.550
are in there waiting for
you to give them a piece


00:40:33.583 --> 00:40:35.085
of your mind.


00:40:59.036 --> 00:41:01.940
- I miss my son.


00:41:05.675 --> 00:41:10.713
I miss the way his hair would
smell sweet after a bath.


00:41:10.746 --> 00:41:15.218
I miss the way his
tiny hand wrapped


00:41:15.251 --> 00:41:17.953
around my finger.


00:41:19.521 --> 00:41:21.755
I have
watched patients stand


00:41:21.788 --> 00:41:24.024
and gaze longingly
towards the city bay


00:41:24.057 --> 00:41:26.961
and all likelihood
will never enter again.


00:41:26.994 --> 00:41:30.563
- Miss Fox, get away
from the window.


00:41:30.596 --> 00:41:32.799
There's nothing
out there for you.


00:41:32.832 --> 00:41:34.666
- That I am sure.


00:41:34.699 --> 00:41:36.201
- It means
liberty and life,


00:41:36.234 --> 00:41:38.203
it seems so near


00:41:38.236 --> 00:41:40.671
and yet heaven is not
further from hell.


00:41:40.704 --> 00:41:43.007
- Put out your tongue.


00:41:46.175 --> 00:41:48.912
Hold out your wrists.


00:41:53.282 --> 00:41:54.683
Look at my hand.


00:41:54.716 --> 00:41:56.518
- I have done this
again and again.


00:41:56.551 --> 00:41:59.855
- Look at my hand.


00:42:02.689 --> 00:42:04.558
Stretch out your arms
and work your fingers.


00:42:04.591 --> 00:42:05.692
- Surely by now you
have the results


00:42:05.725 --> 00:42:07.094
of such test
written down some...


00:42:09.128 --> 00:42:12.866
- Now stretch out your
arms and work your fingers.


00:42:16.701 --> 00:42:19.169
- What a
mysterious thing madness is.


00:42:19.202 --> 00:42:21.705
I have watched patients
whose lips are forever sealed


00:42:21.738 --> 00:42:23.974
in a perpetual silence.


00:42:24.007 --> 00:42:27.076
They breathe, eat, the
human form is there,


00:42:27.109 --> 00:42:30.746
but that something which
cannot exist without the body


00:42:30.779 --> 00:42:31.847
is missing.


00:42:31.880 --> 00:42:34.716
- Who sent you here?


00:42:34.749 --> 00:42:36.651
- The doctors.


00:42:36.684 --> 00:42:39.153
- For what?


00:42:39.186 --> 00:42:41.222
- Well they say I am insane.


00:42:42.956 --> 00:42:45.025
- Insane?


00:42:45.058 --> 00:42:47.528
It cannot be seen on your face.


00:42:49.361 --> 00:42:50.763
- Give me that!


00:42:50.796 --> 00:42:52.731
No reading, where
did you get this?


00:42:52.764 --> 00:42:53.965
- I found it.


00:42:53.998 --> 00:42:55.633
- This belongs to the nurses.


00:42:55.666 --> 00:42:58.036
If I catch you touching
the nurses' things again,


00:42:58.069 --> 00:43:01.272
I will send you
to the quiet room.


00:43:04.174 --> 00:43:05.708
- We're not allowed to read?


00:43:05.741 --> 00:43:09.045
- No, nothing that excites
the mind of fervent thinking.


00:43:09.078 --> 00:43:10.613
There are women who
have committed here


00:43:10.646 --> 00:43:12.147
for excessive reading.


00:43:12.180 --> 00:43:13.782
- For reading too much,
that's ridiculous.


00:43:13.815 --> 00:43:16.151
- You're too loud,
they will hear you.


00:43:16.184 --> 00:43:23.189
- Quiet ladies.


00:43:27.193 --> 00:43:28.694
- I
couldn't help but wonder


00:43:28.727 --> 00:43:31.296
about the minds of the nurses.


00:43:31.329 --> 00:43:32.631
What it must have been like


00:43:32.664 --> 00:43:34.165
to constantly fear
loosing control


00:43:34.198 --> 00:43:37.134
over hundreds of
mental patients.


00:43:37.167 --> 00:43:39.170
To fear loosing their position


00:43:39.203 --> 00:43:42.839
and to fear winding up in Blackwells as a patient themselves


00:43:42.872 --> 00:43:44.674
- Nellie Brown.


00:43:44.707 --> 00:43:46.609
- Leona Fox.


00:43:46.642 --> 00:43:48.711
- Why were you
brought to this place?


00:43:48.744 --> 00:43:51.013
- I caught my husband
with our chamber maid.


00:43:51.046 --> 00:43:52.780
Before I could accuse
him of adultery,


00:43:52.813 --> 00:43:56.117
he signed the papers to
have me committed for life.


00:44:00.320 --> 00:44:03.723
- Did you tell the doctors?


00:44:03.756 --> 00:44:06.258
- My accusations are
called delusional,


00:44:06.291 --> 00:44:08.660
proof to them of my
demented fantasies.


00:44:08.693 --> 00:44:11.763
But I saw them with
my own two eyes.


00:44:14.965 --> 00:44:19.036
A woman has no voice when
man signs her way as insane.


00:44:19.069 --> 00:44:22.105
It is only
after one is in trouble,


00:44:22.138 --> 00:44:24.040
that one realizes
how little sympathy


00:44:24.073 --> 00:44:26.875
and kindness there
is in the world.


00:44:45.090 --> 00:44:47.393
- Come out into the hall!


00:44:47.426 --> 00:44:49.227
- It's an invitation to supper.


00:44:49.260 --> 00:44:51.630
- Let's go everybody up,
out in the hall come on.


00:45:50.211 --> 00:45:52.946
- Nellie Brown, come with me.


00:45:52.979 --> 00:45:54.881
- Where am I being taken?


00:45:54.914 --> 00:45:57.350
- A judge is asking
questions about you.


00:45:57.383 --> 00:45:59.785
So you caught the
eye of Dr. Ingram.


00:45:59.818 --> 00:46:02.088
He wishes to speak with you.


00:46:13.864 --> 00:46:15.032
- Do you wish me to
stick out my tongue


00:46:15.065 --> 00:46:17.166
and hold out my hands?


00:46:17.199 --> 00:46:18.735
- No.


00:46:18.768 --> 00:46:21.169
No, that will not be
necessary this time.


00:46:21.202 --> 00:46:23.305
How are you sleeping?


00:46:23.338 --> 00:46:25.741
- How would you
sleep locked in here?


00:46:25.774 --> 00:46:27.441
- I'm here to help you.


00:46:27.474 --> 00:46:28.776
- Help me?


00:46:28.809 --> 00:46:30.277
- Yes, is there
anything bothering you


00:46:30.310 --> 00:46:32.879
that you would
like to talk about?


00:46:32.912 --> 00:46:36.449
- Yes, in case a fire should
break out in the asylum,


00:46:36.482 --> 00:46:38.884
all of the doors are
locked separately


00:46:38.917 --> 00:46:40.285
and the windows
are heavily bared


00:46:40.318 --> 00:46:42.254
so that escape is impossible.


00:46:42.287 --> 00:46:44.089
A fire is not improbable,


00:46:44.122 --> 00:46:45.923
but one of the most
likely occurrences.


00:46:45.956 --> 00:46:47.925
- Your nurses are expected
to open the doors.


00:46:47.958 --> 00:46:49.260
- Should the building burn,


00:46:49.293 --> 00:46:50.927
the jailers or nurses would
never think of releasing


00:46:50.960 --> 00:46:52.462
their crazy patients.


00:46:52.495 --> 00:46:56.932
These women will be
left to roast to death.


00:46:56.965 --> 00:46:58.200
Why don't you have a change?


00:46:58.233 --> 00:47:01.469
- I offer suggestions
until my brain is tired.


00:47:01.502 --> 00:47:03.071
But what would you do,


00:47:03.104 --> 00:47:05.340
a proclaimed insane girl?


00:47:05.373 --> 00:47:08.809
- Well I should insist on
them having locks put in,


00:47:08.842 --> 00:47:10.210
as I have seen in some places


00:47:10.243 --> 00:47:12.813
that by turning a crank
at the end of the hall,


00:47:12.846 --> 00:47:16.783
you can lock or unlock
every door on the one side.


00:47:16.816 --> 00:47:19.818
Then there is some
chance of escape.


00:47:19.851 --> 00:47:21.553
Now every door being
locked separately,


00:47:21.586 --> 00:47:24.055
there is absolutely none.


00:47:24.088 --> 00:47:25.856
- What institution
were you a inmate of


00:47:25.889 --> 00:47:27.925
before you came here?


00:47:30.027 --> 00:47:33.096
- None, I never was
confined to any institution.


00:47:33.129 --> 00:47:36.198
- Well then where did you see
the locks you have described.


00:47:36.231 --> 00:47:40.035
- I've seen them in
places I was in...


00:47:40.068 --> 00:47:42.537
I mean as a visitor.


00:47:42.570 --> 00:47:44.272
- There is only one
place I know of,


00:47:44.305 --> 00:47:46.007
where where they
have those locks.


00:47:46.040 --> 00:47:48.241
And that is at Sin Sing


00:47:48.274 --> 00:47:51.578
and the only ones going through
Sin Sing besides the inmates


00:47:51.611 --> 00:47:55.514
are the guards,
lawyers, and reporters.


00:47:56.715 --> 00:48:01.319
I assure you I had never update
been an inmate of Sin Sing


00:48:01.352 --> 00:48:03.455
or ever even visited.


00:48:13.562 --> 00:48:15.498
-
There were whispers


00:48:15.531 --> 00:48:17.299
that those who attempted
to get word out


00:48:17.332 --> 00:48:19.868
about the conditions
in the asylum,


00:48:19.901 --> 00:48:22.003
disappeared.


00:48:22.036 --> 00:48:24.104
I was increasingly
fearful that my notebook


00:48:24.137 --> 00:48:25.406
would be discovered.


00:48:45.355 --> 00:48:46.824
- Get away from that!


00:49:06.072 --> 00:49:07.474
- Have a look.


00:49:10.376 --> 00:49:13.079
- Exactly as you expected.


00:49:15.613 --> 00:49:20.117
- Urena, what is your age?


00:49:20.150 --> 00:49:23.420
- Why I am fourteen years old.


00:49:23.453 --> 00:49:26.222
- Fourteen years old?


00:49:26.255 --> 00:49:29.893
The doctors say
you are 26, not 14.


00:49:29.926 --> 00:49:32.661
- I am fourteen.


00:49:32.694 --> 00:49:34.196
- The doctors know better,


00:49:34.229 --> 00:49:37.198
they say that you're 26.


00:49:37.231 --> 00:49:39.467
- It is not true.


00:49:39.500 --> 00:49:41.135
I am fourteen years of age.


00:49:41.168 --> 00:49:42.203
You were fourteen


00:49:42.236 --> 00:49:43.937
when the accident happened.


00:49:43.970 --> 00:49:44.671
- What accident?


00:49:44.704 --> 00:49:46.640
What are you talking about?


00:49:48.441 --> 00:49:52.211
- Urena, do you
know where you are?


00:49:52.244 --> 00:49:56.047
- Yes, I am on rig


00:49:56.080 --> 00:49:58.950
at the garment factory.


00:49:58.983 --> 00:50:00.617
- At the garment factory?


00:50:00.650 --> 00:50:03.587
- That is where you
had your accident.


00:50:03.620 --> 00:50:05.389
Fell off the balcony and


00:50:05.422 --> 00:50:07.323
banged you head.


00:50:09.325 --> 00:50:12.594
- It isn't true.


00:50:12.627 --> 00:50:14.930
I'm at the factory
now, I'm on break.


00:50:14.963 --> 00:50:16.431
- It happened 12 years ago


00:50:16.464 --> 00:50:18.399
and that is when you came here.


00:50:18.432 --> 00:50:20.668
- 12 years ago?


00:50:20.701 --> 00:50:23.569
- Yes you fell and became
stuck at the age 14


00:50:23.602 --> 00:50:28.341
and you were sent here to
Blackwell's Women Asylum


00:50:28.374 --> 00:50:29.608
in my care.


00:50:32.577 --> 00:50:34.212
- No.


00:50:34.245 --> 00:50:38.449
It is not true, it is not true.


00:50:44.554 --> 00:50:46.989
Am I not at the factory?


00:50:47.022 --> 00:50:48.991
- No you're not at
the garment factory.


00:50:49.024 --> 00:50:50.526
You're in an insane asylum.


00:50:52.093 --> 00:50:52.727
- No.


00:50:52.760 --> 00:50:54.128
- No.


00:50:54.161 --> 00:50:55.063
- No!


00:50:55.096 --> 00:50:56.164
- No.


00:50:56.197 --> 00:50:57.165
- No!


00:50:57.198 --> 00:50:57.598
- No.


00:50:57.631 --> 00:50:58.332
- No!


00:50:58.365 --> 00:50:58.966
- No.


00:50:58.999 --> 00:50:59.533
- No!


00:50:59.566 --> 00:51:01.201
- No.


00:51:01.234 --> 00:51:03.103
- No it is not true.


00:51:03.136 --> 00:51:04.270
- Oh okay.


00:51:05.304 --> 00:51:06.639
Don't you push me around.


00:51:06.672 --> 00:51:09.541
I'm taking you to
the quiet room.


00:51:09.574 --> 00:51:10.575
Let's go.


00:51:16.546 --> 00:51:19.483
- Blackwell's
had a stench to it.


00:51:19.516 --> 00:51:21.084
Partly from the kitchens


00:51:21.117 --> 00:51:24.520
and partly from the
onsite crematorium.


00:51:24.553 --> 00:51:25.688
It had become clear to me


00:51:25.721 --> 00:51:28.724
that Blackwell's
was dumping ground.


00:51:28.757 --> 00:51:30.459
A place for the
city to rid itself


00:51:30.492 --> 00:51:33.494
of the overflow of the poor.


00:51:33.527 --> 00:51:36.564
Once committed, there
was no way to exit,


00:51:36.597 --> 00:51:39.266
except through the crematorium.


00:51:42.368 --> 00:51:44.169
What'd
you know about her?


00:51:44.202 --> 00:51:45.504
- Not much.


00:51:45.537 --> 00:51:48.774
She's arrogant and
a troublemaker.


00:51:48.807 --> 00:51:51.676
- Is she responding
to treatment?


00:51:51.709 --> 00:51:53.678
- We have her on Laudannum.


00:51:53.711 --> 00:51:56.313
Increase the dosage.


00:51:57.380 --> 00:51:59.249
- Hello Mrs. McGuinness.


00:51:59.282 --> 00:52:02.251
- Hello Miss Brown.


00:52:02.284 --> 00:52:03.719
- Why were you brought here?


00:52:03.752 --> 00:52:05.755
- I was sick.


00:52:05.788 --> 00:52:07.255
- Are you sick mentally?


00:52:07.288 --> 00:52:08.456
- No, no.


00:52:08.489 --> 00:52:12.093
I had been overworking
myself and I broke down.


00:52:12.126 --> 00:52:15.429
Having some family troubles
and being penniless


00:52:15.462 --> 00:52:16.697
and nowhere to go,


00:52:16.730 --> 00:52:18.132
I applied to the Commissioner's


00:52:18.165 --> 00:52:19.332
to be sent to the poor house


00:52:19.365 --> 00:52:22.268
until I would be
able to work again.


00:52:22.301 --> 00:52:24.037
- But they do not
send poor people here,


00:52:24.070 --> 00:52:26.471
unless they are insane?


00:52:26.504 --> 00:52:28.407
Don't you know there
are only insane women


00:52:28.440 --> 00:52:31.075
or those supposed
to be so sent here?


00:52:31.108 --> 00:52:33.744
- There are 1600 women
on Blackwell's Island,


00:52:33.777 --> 00:52:35.146
I knew when I got here


00:52:35.179 --> 00:52:37.180
that the majority of
these women were insane,


00:52:37.213 --> 00:52:39.482
but then I believed
them when they told me


00:52:39.515 --> 00:52:42.217
that this is the place
where they send all the poor


00:52:42.250 --> 00:52:44.153
who had applied for
aid, as I had done.


00:52:44.186 --> 00:52:46.121
- Really, I'm going to kill you.


00:52:46.154 --> 00:52:47.455
I'm going to kill you!


00:52:47.488 --> 00:52:49.257
- Who are they?


00:52:49.290 --> 00:52:51.459
- They're the women of the rope.


00:52:51.492 --> 00:52:53.093
They're considered to be
the most violent women


00:52:53.126 --> 00:52:54.728
on the island.


00:52:54.761 --> 00:52:56.363
The live in the lodge.


00:52:56.629 --> 00:52:59.398
I, myself, share
the fear that everyone felt,


00:52:59.431 --> 00:53:02.768
the possibility of being
sent to the violent ward.


00:53:02.801 --> 00:53:05.737
The mortality rate
there was high.


00:53:14.244 --> 00:53:15.746
One day a woman was brought in


00:53:15.779 --> 00:53:18.181
who had a fear of being touched


00:53:18.214 --> 00:53:22.518
and an extreme fear
of uncleanliness.


00:53:26.488 --> 00:53:27.755
- Sit down where
we get you set up,


00:53:27.788 --> 00:53:36.797
with a room and proper gown.


00:53:41.299 --> 00:53:43.202
- I'm Nellie Brown.


00:53:43.235 --> 00:53:44.470
- Margaret.


00:53:44.503 --> 00:53:49.541
- Tillie Mayard.


00:53:53.910 --> 00:53:54.878
- Put this on.


00:53:54.911 --> 00:53:56.445
- What here?


00:53:56.478 --> 00:53:58.781
- You left modesty
in the outside world.


00:53:58.814 --> 00:54:01.684
In Blackwell's we
have nothing to hide.


00:54:01.717 --> 00:54:04.285
- No I will not, it
is not dignified.


00:54:04.318 --> 00:54:07.222
That rag is soiled, I will
not put that dirty thing...


00:54:07.255 --> 00:54:08.822
No, no!


00:54:08.855 --> 00:54:10.324
Stop it no!


00:54:10.357 --> 00:54:12.326
Get your hands off me!


00:54:17.696 --> 00:54:22.534
No please.


00:54:26.803 --> 00:54:30.374
Please stop it, stop it.


00:54:30.407 --> 00:54:31.774
No.


00:54:48.454 --> 00:54:51.592
- I'll kill the devils
between my life.


00:54:55.561 --> 00:54:56.896
Poor
Matilda had finally


00:54:56.929 --> 00:54:59.398
avenged the attorneys
who stole her estate.


00:54:59.431 --> 00:55:00.665
- Take her to the retreat.


00:55:00.698 --> 00:55:01.799
- By
plunging the cook's knife


00:55:01.832 --> 00:55:03.868
into the heart of
one of the nurses.


00:55:03.901 --> 00:55:07.738
She was immediately sent to the
violent ward in the retreat.


00:55:11.840 --> 00:55:15.311
Is
it Nellie Brown.


00:55:17.745 --> 00:55:19.548
- Louise?


00:55:20.949 --> 00:55:22.684
Louise Schanz?


00:55:25.752 --> 00:55:27.188
Yes it's me.


00:55:27.221 --> 00:55:30.490
It's so cold.


00:55:33.693 --> 00:55:37.696
God, let me die.


00:56:18.296 --> 00:56:20.898
- Let me go.


00:56:30.773 --> 00:56:33.976
- Get your hands off me.


00:56:34.009 --> 00:56:37.012
Stop, stop!


00:56:37.045 --> 00:56:39.747
Let go of me.


00:56:56.027 --> 00:56:58.363
- They held
Margaret naked in the cold bath


00:56:58.396 --> 00:56:59.798
all through the night.


00:57:01.398 --> 00:57:03.734
- Help me carry her to her room.


00:57:29.721 --> 00:57:30.856
They inject into


00:57:30.889 --> 00:57:33.759
or force so much
opium on the patients,


00:57:33.792 --> 00:57:36.794
that the patients
are made crazy.


00:57:36.827 --> 00:57:38.729
A sure way to lose one's mind


00:57:38.762 --> 00:57:42.899
into the walls of
Blackwell's forever.


00:58:10.788 --> 00:58:13.792
- Everybody up bath
time, single file!


00:58:13.825 --> 00:58:16.427
- Do not take a
bath in that water.


00:58:16.460 --> 00:58:18.028
The very disease for
which I am suffering,


00:58:18.061 --> 00:58:19.963
and for which I need
doctoring makes it necessary


00:58:19.996 --> 00:58:22.098
that I should not
bathe in cold water.


00:58:22.131 --> 00:58:23.800
I do not want to
go into that water.


00:58:23.833 --> 00:58:26.102
It is filthy and filled
with human excrement


00:58:26.135 --> 00:58:29.605
and the burst eruptions
of sick patients' skin.


00:58:42.849 --> 00:58:44.717
- She's dead.


00:58:44.750 --> 00:58:46.618
How was she last night?


00:58:46.651 --> 00:58:48.887
These bruises on her cheeks,


00:58:48.920 --> 00:58:52.423
it looks as if she
was in a fight.


00:58:52.456 --> 00:58:55.727
- She was agitated doctor.


00:58:55.760 --> 00:58:57.828
- I see.


00:58:57.861 --> 00:59:01.532
Obviously she died
of convulsion.


00:59:04.733 --> 00:59:07.636
I'll make out the
death certificate.


00:59:09.771 --> 00:59:11.139
I'm finished here.


00:59:11.172 --> 00:59:12.607
-
Margaret was cremated


00:59:12.640 --> 00:59:16.009
and put into lead tin
with only a number,


00:59:16.042 --> 00:59:18.612
like many hundreds before her.


00:59:50.070 --> 00:59:54.174
- Don't stop Miss
Brown, play another.


00:59:54.207 --> 00:59:56.576
- I never learned to dance.


00:59:56.609 --> 00:59:58.745
- It isn't that difficult.


00:59:58.778 --> 00:59:59.812
- I said no.


01:00:31.572 --> 01:00:33.808
- I can play no more.


01:00:33.841 --> 01:00:35.575
My hands have stoke up.


01:00:35.608 --> 01:00:36.743
- No matter,


01:00:36.776 --> 01:00:39.045
when one has music
in one's spirit.


01:00:54.123 --> 01:00:55.859
- No.


01:01:37.226 --> 01:01:39.829
- I want to go home.


01:02:15.124 --> 01:02:17.159
- How are you doing?


01:02:17.192 --> 01:02:18.760
I'm super intendant.


01:02:18.793 --> 01:02:22.063
Anne how are you today?


01:02:23.730 --> 01:02:25.199
- Stay back.


01:02:28.001 --> 01:02:29.036
She has a fever.


01:02:29.069 --> 01:02:30.303
What is this patient's name?


01:02:30.336 --> 01:02:32.605
- Her name is Louise Schanz.


01:02:32.638 --> 01:02:33.773
She doesn't belong here


01:02:33.806 --> 01:02:36.208
they took her baby away
at Belview Hospital.


01:02:39.344 --> 01:02:41.212
- Louise?


01:02:41.245 --> 01:02:42.713
- She is suffering from the cold


01:02:42.746 --> 01:02:44.048
and insufficient clothing.


01:02:44.081 --> 01:02:46.050
- The nurses will beat you.


01:02:46.083 --> 01:02:47.084
- Take her away.


01:03:04.164 --> 01:03:08.302
So what do you know
of Louise Schanz


01:03:08.335 --> 01:03:10.903
and why do you care?


01:03:10.936 --> 01:03:12.605
- I know that she is sane


01:03:12.638 --> 01:03:14.840
and does not belong
in this place.


01:03:14.873 --> 01:03:16.174
I know that her English is poor


01:03:16.207 --> 01:03:18.777
and she has no way to speak
her case to any justice.


01:03:18.810 --> 01:03:20.745
- I see


01:03:20.778 --> 01:03:24.915
and how did you get here?


01:03:24.948 --> 01:03:28.351
- I was committed as an
insane woman in this asylum.


01:03:28.384 --> 01:03:29.986
I am here without
hope of release.


01:03:30.019 --> 01:03:31.721
- And you think you are insane?


01:03:31.754 --> 01:03:32.955
- No I am not insane.


01:03:32.988 --> 01:03:36.625
- Of course,
everybody says that.


01:03:36.658 --> 01:03:38.093
- So you think,


01:03:38.126 --> 01:03:40.995
Mrs. Schanz is being persecuted?


01:03:42.630 --> 01:03:43.931
- No not persecuted but...


01:03:43.964 --> 01:03:46.700
- You said she's
wrongfully committed here.


01:03:46.733 --> 01:03:47.667
- Yes but...


01:03:47.700 --> 01:03:49.369
- So you are not insane,


01:03:49.402 --> 01:03:51.737
Mrs. Schanz is not insane.


01:03:51.770 --> 01:03:55.274
Is everyone wrongfully
committed here as well?


01:03:58.275 --> 01:04:00.044
- I can see that these
patients need help.


01:04:00.077 --> 01:04:02.179
- And you Florence Nightingale


01:04:02.212 --> 01:04:04.181
are going to help them all.


01:04:04.214 --> 01:04:05.749
Is that it?


01:04:07.883 --> 01:04:11.988
Delusions such as these can
be cured with medication.


01:04:12.021 --> 01:04:14.623
- They force me to drink
the medication every night,


01:04:14.656 --> 01:04:15.857
it's not right.


01:04:15.890 --> 01:04:18.259
- No we're giving you
the wrong medication.


01:04:18.292 --> 01:04:21.261
I don't recall seeing
a medical degree


01:04:21.294 --> 01:04:23.330
on your admission papers.


01:04:23.363 --> 01:04:25.165
Did I miss something?


01:04:29.168 --> 01:04:32.070
You really must
trust me Miss Brown.


01:04:32.103 --> 01:04:35.307
We are the doctors
here, not you.


01:04:35.340 --> 01:04:39.810
I am a doctor and I want
the best for my patients.


01:04:39.843 --> 01:04:41.312
I truly do.


01:04:44.947 --> 01:04:49.218
Tell Dr. Kinier to increase
Miss Brown's nightly dose


01:04:49.251 --> 01:04:53.688
of Laudannum to 150
parts per thousand.


01:04:53.721 --> 01:04:55.390
- Yes Doctor.


01:04:55.423 --> 01:04:57.925
- That should put
your mind at rest.


01:04:57.958 --> 01:05:01.695
You see, I'm just
trying the best I can.


01:05:04.297 --> 01:05:06.199
Have a good day.


01:05:10.402 --> 01:05:12.304
- Go on, mind your business.


01:05:24.814 --> 01:05:26.315
- I want my book and pencil.


01:05:26.348 --> 01:05:28.316
It helps me remember things.


01:05:28.349 --> 01:05:30.719
- You can't have it, so shut up.


01:05:30.752 --> 01:05:34.389
- Give it back or I shall
have to tell Dr. Ingram.


01:05:36.790 --> 01:05:38.059
- You had no book or pencil.


01:05:38.092 --> 01:05:40.060
- I just watched you
place it in your apron.


01:05:40.093 --> 01:05:42.729
- I advise you to fight
against the imaginations


01:05:42.762 --> 01:05:43.964
of your brain.


01:05:55.106 --> 01:05:58.375
- Benny, is that
my husband Benny?


01:05:58.408 --> 01:05:59.843
- I'm sure your mistaken.


01:05:59.876 --> 01:06:01.178
- It's Benny.


01:06:01.211 --> 01:06:02.778
Benny my husband, he's come
to take me out of here.


01:06:02.811 --> 01:06:04.880
- Stop it, that is
not your husband.


01:06:04.913 --> 01:06:06.348
- It's Benny, he's
come to free me.


01:06:06.381 --> 01:06:08.116
- Benny I'm here.
- No dear.


01:06:08.149 --> 01:06:10.385
- Benny, Benny.
- Give up alright.


01:06:10.418 --> 01:06:12.254
He's come to free me Benny.


01:06:14.187 --> 01:06:15.355
- Just leave her alone.


01:06:15.388 --> 01:06:16.957
- Benny take me out of here.


01:06:16.990 --> 01:06:18.358
- Leave her alone.


01:06:18.391 --> 01:06:19.259
- Let's go.


01:06:19.292 --> 01:06:21.161
- Stop!


01:06:28.399 --> 01:06:32.236
- Inmates running the asylum...


01:06:32.269 --> 01:06:34.872
I don't think so.


01:06:39.041 --> 01:06:42.845
You have brought this
particular lesson on yourself.


01:06:56.956 --> 01:06:58.291
Miss Grupe?


01:06:58.324 --> 01:07:00.426
Yes Doctor?


01:07:00.459 --> 01:07:04.330
- What happened to this patient?


01:07:04.363 --> 01:07:06.998
- She was trying
to escape doctor.


01:07:07.031 --> 01:07:09.234
She had the delusions
that her husband is coming


01:07:09.267 --> 01:07:12.202
to take her out of Blackwell's.


01:07:12.235 --> 01:07:15.539
- How did she get
those black eyes?


01:07:15.572 --> 01:07:19.408
- She had the bruises
when she was brought in.


01:07:19.441 --> 01:07:23.512
- Now, they look fresh to me.


01:07:23.545 --> 01:07:28.383
Are you sure she had
it when she came in?


01:07:28.416 --> 01:07:32.153
- I will have a good
talking with the orderlies.


01:07:32.186 --> 01:07:33.755
Get to the bottom of this.


01:07:35.588 --> 01:07:38.458
- Make sure you do that.


01:07:38.491 --> 01:07:42.828
This is not a prison Miss Grupe.


01:07:42.861 --> 01:07:44.797
It's a medical facility,


01:07:44.830 --> 01:07:47.131
where we're trying
to help people,


01:07:47.164 --> 01:07:49.300
to give them a better life.


01:07:49.333 --> 01:07:50.902
Is that clear Miss Grupe?


01:07:50.935 --> 01:07:52.435
- Yes Doctor.


01:07:52.468 --> 01:07:54.004
As it turned out,


01:07:54.037 --> 01:07:56.573
Mrs. Cotter wasn't delusional.


01:07:56.606 --> 01:07:58.541
Her husband Benny had
actually been doing everything


01:07:58.574 --> 01:08:01.277
in his power to take
her out of Blackwell's,


01:08:01.310 --> 01:08:04.212
but was caught in bureaucracy.


01:08:05.279 --> 01:08:07.983
Eventually he trialed
and won her release.


01:08:54.187 --> 01:08:56.522
- What is it now Miss Grupe?


01:08:56.555 --> 01:09:00.025
- One of the nurses took
this from the patient,


01:09:00.058 --> 01:09:01.492
Nellie Brown.


01:09:01.525 --> 01:09:04.429
- Let me have it.


01:09:08.899 --> 01:09:10.234
Has anyone seen this?


01:09:10.267 --> 01:09:12.236
- No Doctor.


01:09:12.269 --> 01:09:16.372
- It's very organized and
articulate for a mental patient.


01:09:17.206 --> 01:09:18.573
- There is something
else Doctor.


01:09:18.606 --> 01:09:20.141
- Well?


01:09:20.174 --> 01:09:23.445
- A reporter is here asking
to speak with Nellie Brown.


01:09:23.478 --> 01:09:26.480
- A reporter?


01:09:30.283 --> 01:09:35.055
It is the fault of that meddling
judge who sent her here.


01:09:39.057 --> 01:09:41.392
We can't deny them
access to her.


01:09:41.425 --> 01:09:44.528
That would only create
a sensational story.


01:09:44.561 --> 01:09:46.664
Let him meet with her.


01:09:46.697 --> 01:09:49.466
But make sure they're
never out of close sight


01:09:49.499 --> 01:09:51.001
of the nursing staff.


01:09:51.034 --> 01:09:52.168
- Yes Doctor.


01:09:52.201 --> 01:09:55.004
- And if she says
anything, anything


01:09:55.037 --> 01:09:58.307
that could be harmful
to this institution,


01:09:58.340 --> 01:09:59.908
see that she's cut off.


01:10:03.144 --> 01:10:05.246
- Here put that on quickly.


01:10:17.255 --> 01:10:18.523
- If you make it a
practice of telling,


01:10:18.556 --> 01:10:20.191
it will be a serious
thing for you.


01:10:20.224 --> 01:10:21.559
To my surprise,


01:10:21.591 --> 01:10:23.060
I was brought face-to-face
with the first reporter


01:10:23.093 --> 01:10:24.428
I had ever worked alongside


01:10:24.461 --> 01:10:25.996
at the Pittsburgh Dispatch.


01:10:26.029 --> 01:10:27.430
- I do not know this man.


01:10:27.463 --> 01:10:29.032
- Do you know her?


01:10:29.065 --> 01:10:30.700
- No this is not the young
lady, I came in search of.


01:10:30.733 --> 01:10:33.435
I was mistaken, I thought
she was somebody else,


01:10:33.468 --> 01:10:36.271
somebody I knew a long time ago.


01:10:36.304 --> 01:10:39.240
- If you do not know her,
you cannot stay here.


01:10:40.174 --> 01:10:42.009
- One moment Señor...


01:10:42.042 --> 01:10:43.978
Do you speak Spanish, Señor?


01:10:44.011 --> 01:10:45.211
- No...


01:10:45.244 --> 01:10:46.579
What in places are
you doing in here?


01:10:46.612 --> 01:10:50.649
- It's alright, I'm after
an item, keep still.


01:10:50.682 --> 01:10:54.119
- No I'm afraid I do not
speak a word of Spanish.


01:10:54.152 --> 01:10:55.521
It was
Wilson, who's article


01:10:55.554 --> 01:10:57.188
I had anonymously responded to,


01:10:57.221 --> 01:11:00.158
that launched my
career as a reporter.


01:11:21.274 --> 01:11:22.242
- Come with me.


01:11:22.275 --> 01:11:24.511
- Please.


01:11:24.544 --> 01:11:27.747
Please I'm so cold,
I can't stay here.


01:11:27.780 --> 01:11:29.549
- Where are you taking her?


01:11:29.582 --> 01:11:35.454
- She needs help.


01:11:39.356 --> 01:11:41.258
- Anne Neville was one
of the quietest women


01:11:41.291 --> 01:11:42.759
in the institution.


01:11:42.792 --> 01:11:45.128
To protect herself
and her sanity,


01:11:45.161 --> 01:11:48.530
she did everything she was
told without complaint.


01:11:48.563 --> 01:11:50.232
I admired her strength


01:11:50.265 --> 01:11:53.168
and determination of will.


01:11:53.201 --> 01:11:57.171
♪ Mid pleasures


01:11:57.204 --> 01:12:00.707
♪ And palaces


01:12:00.740 --> 01:12:05.478
♪ Though we may roam


01:12:06.545 --> 01:12:10.182
♪ Be it ever


01:12:10.215 --> 01:12:13.385
♪ So humble


01:12:13.418 --> 01:12:15.487
♪ There's no


01:12:15.520 --> 01:12:20.290
♪ Place like home


01:12:20.323 --> 01:12:23.760
♪ A charm from


01:12:23.793 --> 01:12:26.496
♪ The sky


01:12:26.529 --> 01:12:31.533
♪ Seems to hallow us here


01:12:34.201 --> 01:12:39.073
♪ Which seek through the world


01:12:39.473 --> 01:12:44.478
♪ Is ne'er met with elsewhere


01:12:47.846 --> 01:12:53.051
♪ Home, home


01:12:53.217 --> 01:12:56.587
♪ Sweet, sweet


01:12:56.620 --> 01:12:58.789
♪ Home


01:12:58.822 --> 01:13:02.492
♪ There's no place


01:13:02.525 --> 01:13:04.493
♪ Like home ♪


01:13:04.526 --> 01:13:06.429
- Get away from here.


01:13:20.773 --> 01:13:23.510
- Everybody up, bath
time single file!


01:13:32.316 --> 01:13:34.852
- I don't think I'm
going to survive today.


01:13:34.885 --> 01:13:38.055
- Don't fight them, they'll
move you through faster.


01:13:47.462 --> 01:13:49.297
As much
as I hated the baths,


01:13:49.330 --> 01:13:50.465
I would have taken another


01:13:50.498 --> 01:13:55.269
if it could've saved
Tillie from hers.


01:13:59.172 --> 01:14:01.173
My heart ached to
see Tille Mayard go


01:14:01.206 --> 01:14:02.575
from recovered from her sickness


01:14:02.608 --> 01:14:04.643
when she had been
brought to Blackwell's,


01:14:04.676 --> 01:14:08.513
to growing ever sicker
as they days wore on.


01:14:08.546 --> 01:14:11.583
Tillie had changed so
much for the worse,


01:14:11.616 --> 01:14:14.418
that I was mortified
when I looked at her.


01:14:24.325 --> 01:14:26.695
- You must keep your spirits up.


01:14:39.338 --> 01:14:42.307
- It is cruel to lock people
up and then freeze them.


01:14:42.340 --> 01:14:44.710
- She has as much
has any of the rest,


01:14:44.743 --> 01:14:45.878
she'll get no more.


01:14:55.685 --> 01:14:56.920
- Let her fall on the floor


01:14:56.953 --> 01:14:58.420
and this will
teach her a lesson.


01:14:59.855 --> 01:15:01.323
- You are cruel to
treat her this way,


01:15:01.356 --> 01:15:03.459
can't you see she is
suffering and in need of care.


01:15:03.492 --> 01:15:05.760
- She needs medical help.


01:15:15.568 --> 01:15:18.571
- You must send help for a
patient, Miss Tille Mayard.


01:15:18.604 --> 01:15:19.906
She is having a
fit from the cold


01:15:19.939 --> 01:15:21.840
and the nurses are not
sending for a doctor.


01:15:21.873 --> 01:15:23.441
They're doing
nothing to help her.


01:15:23.474 --> 01:15:25.443
- Please calm
yourself Miss Brown.


01:15:25.476 --> 01:15:27.745
- See that Dr. Kinier is
dispatched to Miss Tillie Mayard


01:15:27.778 --> 01:15:29.947
at once.


01:15:29.980 --> 01:15:32.383
There see, she will be helped.


01:15:32.416 --> 01:15:34.284
Now please, calm yourself.


01:15:34.317 --> 01:15:35.351
- I will not.


01:15:35.384 --> 01:15:36.586
The cold is so bad,


01:15:36.619 --> 01:15:38.587
it sent Miss Mayard into a fit.


01:15:38.620 --> 01:15:41.356
I fear she will not survive.


01:15:41.389 --> 01:15:47.729
- I will see to
these things at once.


01:15:52.398 --> 01:15:53.500
- Why?


01:15:53.533 --> 01:15:56.202
Why am I being given
special treatment?


01:15:56.235 --> 01:15:59.271
Why is the Assistant
Superintendent so interested


01:15:59.304 --> 01:16:00.839
in my case, in particular?


01:16:00.872 --> 01:16:03.441
- We care about the
treatment of all patients


01:16:03.474 --> 01:16:05.911
at Blackwell's Insane Asylum.


01:16:09.246 --> 01:16:12.316
And a Judge Duffy has
been sending reporters


01:16:12.349 --> 01:16:14.517
to ask about you.


01:16:16.285 --> 01:16:19.221
Tell me, do you
think you are insane?


01:16:21.356 --> 01:16:22.657
- Yes insane.


01:16:22.690 --> 01:16:25.626
I have watched insanity
slowly creeping over minds


01:16:25.659 --> 01:16:27.528
that had appeared to be alright.


01:16:27.561 --> 01:16:31.331
I curse all doctors, nurses,
and public institutions


01:16:31.364 --> 01:16:32.532
for their treatment of people


01:16:32.565 --> 01:16:34.768
that have no advocacy.


01:16:38.503 --> 01:16:42.340
- I will order Miss Grady
to see that more clothing


01:16:42.373 --> 01:16:45.543
is given to the patients.


01:17:05.992 --> 01:17:08.328
- Hand it over,
you know the rules.


01:17:08.361 --> 01:17:09.596
No reading.


01:17:09.629 --> 01:17:10.830
- It is only a book of psalms.


01:17:10.863 --> 01:17:12.765
- Reading agitates the mind.


01:17:12.798 --> 01:17:14.667
- How can book of psalms
be bad for the mind?


01:17:14.700 --> 01:17:16.735
- Hand me the book.


01:17:21.306 --> 01:17:27.678
Hand it over.


01:17:31.847 --> 01:17:33.816
You did this to yourself.


01:17:36.785 --> 01:17:38.387
Take her to the quiet room.


01:17:38.420 --> 01:17:43.858
- You're not human.


01:17:57.601 --> 01:17:58.803
- Brown go to the kitchen,


01:17:58.836 --> 01:18:01.006
get a meal and take it
to Mrs. Schanz's room.


01:18:02.639 --> 01:18:03.640
At the
kitchen I was greeted


01:18:03.673 --> 01:18:05.709
with a spread of fresh fruits,


01:18:05.742 --> 01:18:08.444
marveled meats,
and fine cheeses.


01:18:08.477 --> 01:18:10.446
Food, the likes of
which was never shared


01:18:10.479 --> 01:18:12.748
with the patients.


01:18:12.781 --> 01:18:14.582
- Mrs. Schanz is
ill, what about that?


01:18:14.615 --> 01:18:18.320
- That's for the doctor.


01:18:31.830 --> 01:18:34.733
- 150 degrees, I think.


01:18:37.901 --> 01:18:40.638
- How high as your
temperature ever run?


01:18:40.671 --> 01:18:43.740
- Perhaps 101 degrees.


01:18:43.773 --> 01:18:46.877
- It's 99 degrees.


01:18:51.046 --> 01:18:53.515
- I brought you some food.


01:18:53.548 --> 01:18:54.549
- I do not want it.


01:18:54.582 --> 01:18:56.751
- I know how you feel,


01:18:56.784 --> 01:18:59.821
but you need your strength.


01:18:59.854 --> 01:19:01.088
Did they hit you?


01:19:01.121 --> 01:19:04.658
- I have gotten beatings
from Miss Grupe.


01:19:05.991 --> 01:19:09.628
I am so cold.


01:19:09.661 --> 01:19:14.366
I will never see my son again.


01:19:15.733 --> 01:19:18.402
If only I could die.


01:19:24.006 --> 01:19:27.544
Nein, nein, nein.


01:19:29.010 --> 01:19:30.546
Please.


01:19:31.913 --> 01:19:33.782
No, please there's
nothing wrong with me.


01:19:33.815 --> 01:19:35.783
- Now, now, dear Mrs. Schanz.


01:19:35.816 --> 01:19:38.786
We're here to help you.


01:19:38.819 --> 01:19:39.920
Hold her down.


01:19:39.953 --> 01:19:42.655
- No, please.


01:19:42.688 --> 01:19:43.490
- She doesn't need an injection,


01:19:43.523 --> 01:19:44.791
she just needs rest.


01:19:44.824 --> 01:19:45.892
Do not inject her,


01:19:45.925 --> 01:19:48.127
she only had a
mild coughing fit.


01:19:48.160 --> 01:19:49.461
Do not inject her.


01:19:49.494 --> 01:19:51.964
- Miss Brown enough!


01:19:55.065 --> 01:19:57.435
- There, there.


01:20:01.738 --> 01:20:04.073
Isn't that better?


01:20:07.109 --> 01:20:12.114
- Franklin, you've
grown so much.


01:20:13.881 --> 01:20:16.117
Come dance with me.


01:20:43.972 --> 01:20:46.708
- You have killed her.


01:20:46.741 --> 01:20:47.976
You have killed her.


01:20:48.009 --> 01:20:49.677
- Take Miss Brown
back to her room.


01:20:49.710 --> 01:20:52.213
Send Mrs. Schanz
to the crematorium.


01:20:52.246 --> 01:20:54.215
I will make out the papers.


01:20:54.248 --> 01:20:56.483
- You are a cruel
and inhumane man.


01:20:56.516 --> 01:20:59.986
- Why are you fighting
this so much, Miss Brown?


01:21:00.019 --> 01:21:03.656
I'm trying to bring
these people some relief.


01:21:03.689 --> 01:21:05.624
- By killing them?


01:21:05.657 --> 01:21:07.993
- It was not the intention.


01:21:26.941 --> 01:21:29.678
- You have brought
this up on yourself.


01:21:48.025 --> 01:21:49.828
- Get off the grass!


01:21:54.264 --> 01:21:57.968
- Tillie.


01:21:58.001 --> 01:21:59.802
Tillie?


01:21:59.835 --> 01:22:02.972
- I dreamed of my
mother last night.


01:22:03.005 --> 01:22:09.144
I think she may come
today and take me home.


01:22:13.747 --> 01:22:15.682
I'm cold.


01:22:15.715 --> 01:22:18.518
No don't touch me!


01:22:18.551 --> 01:22:20.720
- I'm trying to warm you.


01:22:23.555 --> 01:22:28.025
- You, you are a traitor.


01:22:28.058 --> 01:22:30.227
There doing this to
me because of you.


01:22:30.260 --> 01:22:31.829
- What?


01:22:31.862 --> 01:22:34.864
- You're trying to pass
yourself off as me.


01:22:34.897 --> 01:22:36.032
- Tillie what do you mean?


01:22:36.065 --> 01:22:38.768
- The reporters and the doctors


01:22:38.801 --> 01:22:41.303
that have come calling
to see Nellie Brown


01:22:41.336 --> 01:22:44.039
are friends in search of me.


01:22:44.072 --> 01:22:46.741
But you are, by some means,


01:22:46.774 --> 01:22:50.644
trying to deceive
them that you are me.


01:22:50.677 --> 01:22:52.145
- No Tillie, I am your friend.


01:22:52.178 --> 01:22:55.015
- You are not my friend!


01:22:56.949 --> 01:23:00.620
- I am here because of you.


01:23:05.022 --> 01:23:06.124
- Tillie,


01:23:06.157 --> 01:23:07.991
what have they
been doing to you?


01:23:08.024 --> 01:23:09.159
They've been injecting
you with opium.


01:23:09.192 --> 01:23:12.129
- It's your fault.


01:23:12.162 --> 01:23:14.664
You trick me into singing,


01:23:14.697 --> 01:23:17.934
so you can steal my voice.


01:23:17.967 --> 01:23:19.668
- No.


01:23:21.636 --> 01:23:26.140
- I can't stay in this
place another day.


01:23:30.177 --> 01:23:31.911
- Tillie shut up


01:23:31.944 --> 01:23:33.580
or I will help you to shut up.


01:23:33.613 --> 01:23:35.014
- Tillie.


01:23:35.047 --> 01:23:36.550
- Get away from me.


01:23:46.323 --> 01:23:48.658
- There are 16
doctors on this island


01:23:48.691 --> 01:23:50.060
and excepting two,


01:23:50.093 --> 01:23:52.596
I have never seen them pay
any attention to the patients.


01:23:52.629 --> 01:23:55.798
How can a doctor judge
a woman's sanity,


01:23:55.831 --> 01:23:57.833
merely by bidding
her good morning


01:23:57.866 --> 01:24:00.902
and refusing to hear
her pleas for release?


01:24:02.336 --> 01:24:05.772
You have no right to
keep sane people here.


01:24:05.805 --> 01:24:07.774
I am sane, have always been so


01:24:07.807 --> 01:24:10.010
and I must insist on
a thorough examination


01:24:10.043 --> 01:24:11.911
or be released.


01:24:11.944 --> 01:24:14.180
Several of the women
here are also sane.


01:24:14.213 --> 01:24:15.781
Why can't they be free?


01:24:15.814 --> 01:24:18.917
- They are insane


01:24:18.950 --> 01:24:22.321
and suffering from delusions.


01:24:23.120 --> 01:24:24.688
- You are such a damn whore,


01:24:24.721 --> 01:24:26.924
it's a good thing for you
that you are being transferred


01:24:26.957 --> 01:24:29.158
or I will make you pay
so well for remembering


01:24:29.191 --> 01:24:32.061
to tell Dr. Ingram everything.


01:24:32.094 --> 01:24:33.997
You forget everything
about yourself,


01:24:34.030 --> 01:24:37.166
but you never forget
anything to tell the Doctor.


01:24:51.710 --> 01:24:53.312
- Not sure I'll be able
to sleep with Matilda


01:24:53.345 --> 01:24:54.980
up creeping about.


01:24:55.013 --> 01:24:58.216
- She's probably out searching
for somebody she want to kill


01:24:58.249 --> 01:25:01.252
- Someone down there.


01:25:02.887 --> 01:25:04.955
- I heard the nurses
talking about you.


01:25:04.988 --> 01:25:06.223
- What did they say?


01:25:06.256 --> 01:25:08.291
- You were to be shut
off from all visitors,


01:25:08.324 --> 01:25:12.695
because you talk too
much out of turn.


01:25:12.728 --> 01:25:14.130
- That's why we were
sent to the violent ward


01:25:14.163 --> 01:25:15.730
to get rid of us.


01:25:15.763 --> 01:25:17.699
I puzzled over
why they sent Anne Neville


01:25:17.732 --> 01:25:19.367
to the violent ward with me.


01:25:19.400 --> 01:25:21.802
I determined that it was
the strength of her spirit,


01:25:21.835 --> 01:25:24.038
her unwillingness to let
the nurses break her will


01:25:24.071 --> 01:25:26.205
that had them focused on her.


01:25:26.238 --> 01:25:28.441
So they sent Anne,
the strongest,


01:25:28.474 --> 01:25:32.411
and me, the loudest, to the
violent ward to finish us.


01:25:49.758 --> 01:25:50.993
- Why was I put in here?


01:25:51.026 --> 01:25:51.761
- Shut up.


01:26:02.802 --> 01:26:05.939
- I understand you been
having continuing trouble


01:26:05.972 --> 01:26:10.076
with fever thinking
and hallucinations.


01:26:10.109 --> 01:26:12.911
- I've had nothing of the sort.


01:26:12.944 --> 01:26:15.013
I'm as sane as anyone.


01:26:15.046 --> 01:26:18.716
- You've demonstrated
delusions of persecution,


01:26:18.749 --> 01:26:22.953
thinking that the orderlies
and nurses are against you,


01:26:22.986 --> 01:26:26.289
that they wish to cause you
harm, instead of help you.


01:26:26.322 --> 01:26:30.225
And that we, your
doctors are murderers.


01:26:30.258 --> 01:26:32.160
- The things I have seen,


01:26:32.193 --> 01:26:34.763
the things I have
told to Dr. Ingram,


01:26:34.796 --> 01:26:35.930
all of them are true.


01:26:35.963 --> 01:26:38.499
- There are many truths
here at Blackwell's.


01:26:38.532 --> 01:26:42.969
It is after all, an
asylum for the insane.


01:26:46.105 --> 01:26:49.041
- I do not need an injection,


01:26:49.074 --> 01:26:50.843
I am perfectly sane.


01:26:50.876 --> 01:26:54.312
- Nearly all the patients
here deny their insanity.


01:26:54.345 --> 01:26:56.814
- Besides you nightly medicate
me with an opium drink.


01:26:56.847 --> 01:26:59.449
- It is clear that in your case,


01:26:59.482 --> 01:27:01.919
you need something stronger.


01:27:02.819 --> 01:27:04.854
- No, no, no, no.


01:27:04.887 --> 01:27:05.454
No, no!


01:27:05.487 --> 01:27:06.355
- Hold her still.


01:27:06.388 --> 01:27:08.257
- No, no, no!


01:27:08.290 --> 01:27:10.792
No, no!


01:27:27.972 --> 01:27:29.508
- Let her be for a bit.


01:27:32.210 --> 01:27:33.444
Check back on her in an hour.


01:27:48.356 --> 01:27:51.259
- You better alert
the crematorium.


01:27:55.362 --> 01:27:58.098
- Excuse me, what are you doing?


01:27:58.131 --> 01:27:59.232
- Superintendent Dent?


01:27:59.265 --> 01:28:00.367
- Yes?


01:28:00.400 --> 01:28:02.835
- I am Peter A.
Hendricks esquire.


01:28:02.868 --> 01:28:04.537
I am an attorney
representing a family,


01:28:04.570 --> 01:28:06.372
willing to take
care of the patient,


01:28:06.405 --> 01:28:07.572
known as Nellie Brown.


01:28:07.605 --> 01:28:09.107
- Nellie Brown of course,


01:28:09.140 --> 01:28:11.576
the amnesia case.


01:28:11.609 --> 01:28:16.380
Nellie Brown is unfortunately
a very sick girl


01:28:16.413 --> 01:28:20.183
and I cannot vouch for
the safety of her health.


01:28:20.216 --> 01:28:22.285
If she were to be
released at this time.


01:28:29.991 --> 01:28:33.027
- A Judge Duffy has
signed the order,


01:28:33.060 --> 01:28:36.830
transferring her
into my custody.


01:28:36.863 --> 01:28:40.133
As you can see, it is official.


01:28:44.336 --> 01:28:46.238
- Have a seat.


01:28:46.271 --> 01:28:49.941
We have hundreds of patients
here at Blackwell's,


01:28:49.974 --> 01:28:54.044
it will take a little
time to locate her.


01:28:54.077 --> 01:28:56.046
- I'm not going anywhere.


01:28:56.079 --> 01:28:58.281
- What is the condition
of Nellie Brown?


01:28:58.314 --> 01:29:02.017
- I left Miss McCarten to
take her to the crematorium.


01:29:02.050 --> 01:29:04.119
- Open it, open it!


01:29:07.188 --> 01:29:08.590
Step aside!


01:29:21.433 --> 01:29:25.136
Come Miss Brown,
come back to us.


01:29:25.169 --> 01:29:26.571
Wake up!


01:29:26.604 --> 01:29:27.906
Come out of it!


01:29:27.939 --> 01:29:31.275
Miss Brown, I need
you to wake up!


01:29:44.519 --> 01:29:46.954
- We're ruined.


01:29:46.987 --> 01:29:50.124
Blackwell's will be ended.


01:29:52.358 --> 01:29:54.227
I won't have it.


01:30:06.671 --> 01:30:09.006
- Her heart is beating.


01:30:09.039 --> 01:30:10.240
- What?


01:30:10.273 --> 01:30:11.642
- Her heart is beating!


01:30:14.044 --> 01:30:16.612
- So it works.


01:30:16.645 --> 01:30:19.115
I was right.


01:30:19.148 --> 01:30:22.984
It works.


01:30:23.017 --> 01:30:25.120
Watch over her tonight.


01:30:25.153 --> 01:30:27.588
Make sure she gets
plenty of water.


01:30:27.621 --> 01:30:31.125
At sunrise send
her into the yard.


01:30:31.158 --> 01:30:33.993
Have your nurses keep
close watch over her


01:30:34.026 --> 01:30:35.395
until I call for her.


01:30:35.428 --> 01:30:36.897
- Yes Doctor.


01:30:53.409 --> 01:30:55.945
- Bridget.


01:30:55.978 --> 01:30:57.580
What have they done to you?


01:31:00.182 --> 01:31:03.485
- Insane, it cannot
be seen on your face.


01:31:11.591 --> 01:31:14.360
- Brown, you're to come with me.


01:31:14.393 --> 01:31:15.695
Where am I going?


01:31:15.728 --> 01:31:19.197
- A lawyer, Mr. Hendricks
is here to see you.


01:31:27.137 --> 01:31:31.207
- You are the strongest
woman I have ever met.


01:31:31.240 --> 01:31:33.509
- And you are leaving.


01:31:33.542 --> 01:31:35.510
- I'll be back.


01:31:35.543 --> 01:31:38.180
- No you won't.


01:31:38.213 --> 01:31:42.150
- You'd have to be
crazy to come back here.


01:31:44.318 --> 01:31:48.588
I never want to
see you here again.


01:31:53.158 --> 01:31:55.161
- No hugging.


01:32:07.504 --> 01:32:10.673
- This is Peter A.
Hendricks Esquire.


01:32:10.706 --> 01:32:12.008
He's an attorney.


01:32:12.041 --> 01:32:13.175
- How do you do, Mr. Hendricks.


01:32:13.208 --> 01:32:15.244
- Very well, Miss
Brown thank you.


01:32:15.276 --> 01:32:18.046
- Have a seat Nellie.


01:32:19.714 --> 01:32:24.251
- I represent friends of yours


01:32:24.284 --> 01:32:26.253
that are willing to
take charge of you


01:32:26.286 --> 01:32:27.553
if you'd rather be with them...


01:32:27.586 --> 01:32:28.388
- Yes.


01:32:28.421 --> 01:32:30.256
- Than in the asylum.


01:32:30.289 --> 01:32:31.491
- Yes.


01:32:31.524 --> 01:32:32.325
- Don't you want to
know who they ...


01:32:32.358 --> 01:32:35.027
- No.


01:32:35.060 --> 01:32:37.362
- Very well.


01:32:37.395 --> 01:32:39.397
I will leave you two to chat,


01:32:39.430 --> 01:32:42.700
while I prepare
your release papers.


01:32:47.070 --> 01:32:51.040
- So Miss, Miss Brown.


01:32:51.073 --> 01:32:54.510
Miss Brown, Miss Brown.


01:32:57.211 --> 01:33:00.815
I am instructed to
provide you with anything,


01:33:00.848 --> 01:33:04.484
anything you need on our
journey back to the city.


01:33:04.517 --> 01:33:06.820
- Something to eat immediately.


01:33:06.853 --> 01:33:09.489
- Of course, of course.


01:33:13.324 --> 01:33:14.793
- I had
looked forward so eagerly


01:33:14.826 --> 01:33:17.195
to leaving that horrible place.


01:33:17.228 --> 01:33:19.663
Yet when my release came,


01:33:19.696 --> 01:33:23.600
and I knew that God's sunlight
was to be free for me again,


01:33:23.633 --> 01:33:26.069
there was a certain
pain in leaving.


01:33:26.102 --> 01:33:28.838
- How long was I
in the nuthouse?


01:33:28.871 --> 01:33:32.274
- You mean you don't know?


01:33:36.243 --> 01:33:38.546
- 10 days.


01:34:01.431 --> 01:34:03.266
Could I pass
a week in the Insane Ward


01:34:03.299 --> 01:34:05.468
at Blackwell's island?


01:34:05.501 --> 01:34:07.837
I said I could and would.


01:34:07.870 --> 01:34:11.807
And I did.


01:34:21.414 --> 01:34:23.349
My story spread like wildfire.


01:34:23.382 --> 01:34:25.651
And spread not only
across the U.S.,


01:34:25.684 --> 01:34:27.420
but across the globe.


01:34:27.453 --> 01:34:28.553
I was a news celebrity.


01:34:28.586 --> 01:34:29.855
- Oh Miss Brown.


01:34:29.888 --> 01:34:31.189
I had
proven that a woman


01:34:31.222 --> 01:34:33.258
could do the man's
job of reporting


01:34:33.291 --> 01:34:35.426
by writing the most
successful piece of news


01:34:35.459 --> 01:34:41.298
Joseph Pulitzer
had ever published.


01:34:47.335 --> 01:34:51.139
But my only focus, my only care


01:34:51.172 --> 01:34:54.242
was for the poor unfortunates
left to wither and die


01:34:54.275 --> 01:34:56.511
in that horrid place.


01:34:56.544 --> 01:34:58.745
I was determined to shed
light on their conditions.


01:34:58.778 --> 01:35:00.580
- The nation is in a
fit over your story.


01:35:00.613 --> 01:35:03.349
The mayor of New York has
launched his own investigation


01:35:03.382 --> 01:35:05.484
as of several members
of the city council.


01:35:05.517 --> 01:35:07.386
This changes everything for you.


01:35:07.419 --> 01:35:08.820
- Yes.


01:35:08.853 --> 01:35:12.557
- Nothing will ever be
the same from here on out.


01:35:12.590 --> 01:35:15.359
- No I expect not.


01:35:15.392 --> 01:35:21.131
- Here, this is for you.


01:35:25.401 --> 01:35:26.568
- It is a lot of money.


01:35:26.601 --> 01:35:27.502
- It includes a bonus,


01:35:27.535 --> 01:35:30.572
authorized by Pulitzer himself.


01:35:30.605 --> 01:35:33.207
- I only want the standard pay,


01:35:33.240 --> 01:35:36.377
the rest should
go to the orphans.


01:35:36.410 --> 01:35:39.245
- Oh yes, you've been summoned


01:35:39.278 --> 01:35:40.847
to appear before the grand jury


01:35:40.880 --> 01:35:43.582
about the conditions
at Blackwell's.


01:35:45.984 --> 01:35:47.452
- Do you swear to
tell the truth,


01:35:47.485 --> 01:35:49.453
the whole truth, and
nothing but the truth,


01:35:49.486 --> 01:35:50.488
so help you God?


01:35:50.521 --> 01:35:53.191
- By the grace of God, I do.


01:35:56.659 --> 01:35:58.261
- Please state your name.


01:35:58.294 --> 01:36:00.363
- Elizabeth Jane Cockerit.


01:36:03.365 --> 01:36:05.401
Nellie Bly is my pen name.


01:36:05.434 --> 01:36:07.802
- Can you tell us why
you feigned insanity


01:36:07.835 --> 01:36:09.871
and entered Blackwell's
Island Lunatic Asylum


01:36:09.904 --> 01:36:12.239
posing as a person
of mental illness?


01:36:12.272 --> 01:36:14.408
- I entered Blackwell's
Asylum with the intent


01:36:14.441 --> 01:36:18.444
of writing about and exposing
corruption abuse there of.


01:36:18.477 --> 01:36:21.881
- So this was a page
on dishonest papers?


01:36:21.914 --> 01:36:24.783
- The job of a reporter is to
tell the truth to the people.


01:36:24.816 --> 01:36:27.385
Truth that would
otherwise not be know.


01:36:27.418 --> 01:36:30.354
At first, I took this
assignment with the notion


01:36:30.387 --> 01:36:32.856
of telling the people what
goes on behind the bars


01:36:32.889 --> 01:36:35.525
and locked doors of the asylum.


01:36:35.558 --> 01:36:37.327
But it was not long
before I realized


01:36:37.360 --> 01:36:38.695
that I had deeper reasons.


01:36:38.728 --> 01:36:39.896
- Care to elaborate?


01:36:39.929 --> 01:36:42.664
- The insane asylum
on Blackwell's Island


01:36:42.697 --> 01:36:44.499
is a human rat trap.


01:36:44.532 --> 01:36:46.500
It is easy to get in,


01:36:46.533 --> 01:36:50.805
but once in it is
impossible to get out.


01:36:50.838 --> 01:36:54.774
Here were women taken
without their consent,


01:36:54.807 --> 01:36:57.643
from the free world to an asylum


01:36:57.676 --> 01:37:01.347
and given no chance
to prove their sanity.


01:37:01.380 --> 01:37:03.681
- Your Honor I'm with that the
Grand Jury be taken on a tour


01:37:03.714 --> 01:37:06.251
of Blackwell's Island
Asylum by Miss Cockerin


01:37:06.284 --> 01:37:08.553
and see these events first hand.


01:37:08.586 --> 01:37:09.519
- It is so ordered.


01:37:16.625 --> 01:37:19.562
- The Grand Jury is here.


01:37:19.595 --> 01:37:20.795
- Yes?


01:37:20.828 --> 01:37:25.333
- We must eliminate all
traces of Brown's visit.


01:37:25.366 --> 01:37:27.534
We are in danger.


01:37:27.567 --> 01:37:27.968
- Just go.


01:37:28.001 --> 01:37:28.669
- But...


01:37:28.702 --> 01:37:29.704
- Just go!


01:37:47.851 --> 01:37:49.653
- You must keep
your questions short


01:37:49.686 --> 01:37:52.589
as her health will not allow it.


01:37:54.691 --> 01:37:58.728
- It's me Nellie.


01:38:00.329 --> 01:38:03.398
Tillie do you know me?


01:38:03.431 --> 01:38:06.000
- No.


01:38:06.033 --> 01:38:07.901
I do not know you.


01:38:12.339 --> 01:38:13.606
Should I?


01:38:31.654 --> 01:38:34.324
- This is not how it was
when I was last here.


01:38:34.357 --> 01:38:36.558
- Have you made changes to
the sitting room recently?


01:38:36.591 --> 01:38:37.959
- The sitting room is
always being changed,


01:38:37.992 --> 01:38:39.995
rearranged and cleaned.


01:38:40.028 --> 01:38:41.862
- Where is Miss
Bridget McGuinness?


01:38:41.895 --> 01:38:43.831
- She has been transferred
to other quarters.


01:38:43.864 --> 01:38:45.333
- What about Mrs. Fox?


01:38:45.366 --> 01:38:49.102
- She is dying of paralysis
and you cannot see her.


01:38:49.135 --> 01:38:52.339
- And Anne Neville,
where is Anne Neville.


01:38:52.372 --> 01:38:54.473
- She has been transferred
to isolation in Hall 7


01:38:54.506 --> 01:38:55.674
due to some troubles.


01:38:55.707 --> 01:38:56.742
- See that she is brought to us.


01:39:07.050 --> 01:39:09.720
- Miss Anne Neville
has been brought down.


01:39:09.753 --> 01:39:11.020
She's in the hallway.


01:39:11.053 --> 01:39:12.088
- Send her in.


01:39:36.107 --> 01:39:39.777
- I knew you would come back.


01:39:41.445 --> 01:39:44.115
- Have they been
giving you medicine?


01:39:48.518 --> 01:39:49.853
- I have to admit,


01:39:49.886 --> 01:39:53.856
I was fearful when they
came for me just now.


01:39:53.889 --> 01:39:57.625
They said I was going to be
examined by a crowd of men.


01:39:57.658 --> 01:39:59.460
- It is a Grand Jury,


01:39:59.493 --> 01:40:03.964
here to investigate Blackwell's
and how they treat us.


01:40:03.997 --> 01:40:05.799
- All I want you to do,


01:40:05.832 --> 01:40:08.033
is to tell the jury
all that we have done


01:40:08.066 --> 01:40:10.370
since I was brought
with you to the asylum.


01:40:22.012 --> 01:40:26.649
- When Miss Brown and
I were brought here,


01:40:28.751 --> 01:40:31.053
the nurses were very cruel.


01:40:35.089 --> 01:40:38.760
The food it was too bad to eat.


01:40:41.028 --> 01:40:43.897
There was not enough clothing.


01:40:43.930 --> 01:40:47.634
Miss Brown asked for
more all the time.


01:40:47.667 --> 01:40:49.868
For when the doctors
promised her more clothing,


01:40:49.901 --> 01:40:55.907
she said she would
give it to me.


01:41:00.477 --> 01:41:06.048
Strange to say,


01:41:09.952 --> 01:41:14.088
ever since Miss Brown
has been taken away,


01:41:14.121 --> 01:41:17.991
everything was different.


01:41:18.024 --> 01:41:21.628
Nurses are very kind to us


01:41:21.661 --> 01:41:25.865
and we are given plenty to wear.


01:41:25.898 --> 01:41:31.970
The doctors come
and see us often.


01:41:36.573 --> 01:41:38.876
- All rise


01:41:38.909 --> 01:41:44.514
for the honorable Judge
Henry A. Gildersleeve.


01:41:48.917 --> 01:41:50.886
Be seated.


01:41:54.121 --> 01:41:57.624
- Has the Grand Jury
reached a decision?


01:41:57.657 --> 01:42:00.827
- We have Your Honor.


01:42:00.860 --> 01:42:02.762
We find the Committee
of Appropriation


01:42:02.795 --> 01:42:04.196
be provided one million dollars


01:42:04.229 --> 01:42:05.865
for the benefit of the asylum.


01:42:09.300 --> 01:42:10.935
In spite of
the attempts to cover up


01:42:10.968 --> 01:42:13.204
what had been going
on at Blackwell's,


01:42:13.237 --> 01:42:16.039
the Grand Jury found that
I was telling the truth


01:42:16.072 --> 01:42:17.808
about all I had testified


01:42:17.841 --> 01:42:21.110
and found my testimony
to be credible.


01:42:21.143 --> 01:42:24.146
I have the consolation that
on the strength of my story,


01:42:24.179 --> 01:42:26.548
the million dollars
per year provided


01:42:26.581 --> 01:42:28.283
was more than had
ever before been given


01:42:28.316 --> 01:42:31.086
for the benefit of the insane.


01:42:31.119 --> 01:42:36.123
- My dear girl, you have
no idea what you've done.


01:42:36.557 --> 01:42:39.692
- Oh I know exactly
what I have done.


01:42:39.725 --> 01:42:41.928
Blackwell's is not
a place of healing.


01:42:41.961 --> 01:42:44.263
It is a rat-infested
human death trap.


01:42:44.296 --> 01:42:46.098
- That is due to
the lack of means


01:42:46.131 --> 01:42:48.934
to secure good medical help.


01:42:48.967 --> 01:42:51.202
Blackwell's Asylum
was forced to choose


01:42:51.235 --> 01:42:55.605
among convicted prisoners
from the nearby penitentiary


01:42:55.638 --> 01:42:57.707
to fill out its staff.


01:42:57.740 --> 01:43:01.277
- You stood by as the nurses
inflicted unspeakable cruelties


01:43:01.310 --> 01:43:02.611
upon patients.


01:43:02.644 --> 01:43:04.280
- Maybe being the
superintendent,


01:43:04.313 --> 01:43:07.882
I was too busy to be fully
aware of the atrocities


01:43:07.915 --> 01:43:09.284
that were going on in here.


01:43:09.317 --> 01:43:11.152
- You knew.


01:43:11.185 --> 01:43:13.120
You knew that clothing
meant for the patients


01:43:13.153 --> 01:43:14.621
was being stolen.


01:43:14.654 --> 01:43:16.990
You knew that women in
here were being murdered.


01:43:17.023 --> 01:43:19.825
- How can you say it was murder!


01:43:19.858 --> 01:43:22.295
I was trying to
help these people!


01:43:22.328 --> 01:43:29.134
I was trying to help
science before it!


01:43:33.070 --> 01:43:36.606
- Dr. Dent you have
made a very old mistake.


01:43:36.639 --> 01:43:38.074
Throughout history
there have been those


01:43:38.107 --> 01:43:39.309
who have allowed atrocities


01:43:39.342 --> 01:43:43.679
with a higher ideal
as an end goal.


01:43:43.712 --> 01:43:47.215
- I had no other goal
than to help my patients.


01:43:49.283 --> 01:43:51.619
- I can see I cannot
convince you to the insanity


01:43:51.652 --> 01:43:55.221
of your thinking.


01:43:55.254 --> 01:43:57.824
But I can stop you.


01:43:57.857 --> 01:44:01.794
The state is taking control
of Blackwell's Asylum.


01:44:01.827 --> 01:44:05.063
One of the conditions is
that the facility be closed


01:44:05.096 --> 01:44:06.097
and torn down.


01:44:21.376 --> 01:44:27.081
Goodbye Dr. Dent.


01:44:30.851 --> 01:44:33.686
- The world
was surprised by my story.


01:44:33.719 --> 01:44:35.922
A story written by a woman.


01:44:35.955 --> 01:44:39.324
A story that brought light
to those that had no voice,


01:44:39.357 --> 01:44:42.227
those that society had forgotten


01:44:42.260 --> 01:44:44.162
and reminded us all


01:44:44.195 --> 01:44:47.164
that energy rightly
applied and directed


01:44:47.197 --> 01:44:48.866
will accomplish anything.


