01:45:09.311 --> 01:45:12.749
♪ Where little girls
barely mattered


01:45:12.782 --> 01:45:15.551
♪ Even women couldn't vote


01:45:15.584 --> 01:45:17.520
♪ Their jobs just
left them broke


01:45:17.553 --> 01:45:22.058
♪ Sewing clothes
